básica — Bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578590&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2dfb6baa-131c-4559-909e-5fa6a852f9b3', 'multiverseId': 578590}, 'multiverseid': 578590}, {'name': 'Forêt', 'type': 'Terrain de base : forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578605&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0010f6c4-6335-471f-8b0f-15cba05e707c', 'multiverseId': 578605}, 'multiverseid': 578605}, {'name': 'Foresta', 'type': 'Terra Base — Foresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578620&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e892557-6272-4d7d-aa1b-8e229f770df1', 'multiverseId': 578620}, 'multiverseid': 578620}, {'name': '森', 'type': '基本土地 — 森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578635&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8efbe7ae-82cd-4d59-b553-c323908a77e1', 'multiverseId': 578635}, 'multiverseid': 578635}, {'name': 'Floresta', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Floresta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578665&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33995052-6f5c-4f22-aee3-94a49be2b3cf', 'multiverseId': 578665}, 'multiverseid': 578665}, {'name': '树林', 'type': '基本地 ～树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578695&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65f84219-e3d5-4dc5-aa0d-780ca8a82a9f', 'multiverseId': 578695}, 'multiverseid': 578695}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wandelndes Bollwerk\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\n{2}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Verteidiger Eile, kann angreifen, als ob sie nicht Verteidiger hätte, und weist Kampfschaden in Höhe ihrer Widerstandskraft anstatt ihrer Stärke zu. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49c82de8-4731-4167-b4f5-b1e9a36b0ca3\', \'multiverseId\': 574982}, \'multiverseid\': 574982}, {\'name\': \'Bastión andante\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\n{2}: Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de defensor gana la habilidad de prisa, puede atacar como si no tuviera la habilidad de defensor y asigna una cantidad de daño de combate igual a su resistencia en vez de su fuerza. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75b78a7e-c239-4c2f-be36-adc8160bef59\', \'multiverseId\': 575243}, \'multiverseid\': 575243}, {\'name\': \'Rempart ambulant\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\n{2} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, une créature avec le défenseur ciblée acquiert la célérité, peut attaquer comme si elle n\'avait pas le défenseur, et attribue un nombre de blessures de combat égal à son endurance à la place de sa force. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575504&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b67f92c8-ff2e-4a27-9817-27d6e7a4205e\', \'multiverseId\': 575504}, \'multiverseid\': 575504}, {\'name\': \'Baluardo Ambulante\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\n{2}: Fino alla fine del turno, una creatura bersaglio con difensore ha rapidità, può attaccare come se non avesse difensore e assegna danno da combattimento pari alla sua costituzione invece che alla sua forza. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ab3c29a-ad96-4d86-8c3b-99d7eb1f0e70\', \'multiverseId\': 575765}, \'multiverseid\': 575765}, {\'name\': \'歩く防壁\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n{2}：防衛を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得、防衛を持たないかのように攻撃でき、パワーではなくタフネスに等しい点数の戦闘ダメージを割り振る。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d07dd155-469a-4a2a-921e-2c1b5c1be490\', \'multiverseId\': 576026}, \'multiverseid\': 576026}, {\'name\': \'Baluarte Ambulante\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\n{2}: Até o final do turno, a criatura alvo com defensor ganha ímpeto, pode atacar como se não tivesse defensor e atribui dano de combate igual à própria resistência, em vez de ao próprio poder. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'573a2e30-fb41-4c14-a5cc-4f17b9976202\', \'multiverseId\': 576548}, \'multiverseid\': 576548}, {\'name\': \'自行堡垒\', \'text\': \'守军\\n{2}：直到回合结束，目标具守军异能的生物获得敏捷异能，能视同不具守军异能地进行攻击，且依照其防御力来分配战斗伤害，而不是依照力量。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2af1470b-2dbb-4aca-a1b5-9d641c58c2af\', \'multiverseId\': 577070}, \'multiverseid\': 577070}]', "[{'name': 'Weiterentwickelter Schläfer', 'text': '{B}: Der Weiterentwickelte Schläfer wird zu einem Mensch-Kleriker mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 2/2.\\n{1}{B}: Falls der Weiterentwickelte Schläfer ein Kleriker ist, lege eine Todesberührung-Marke auf ihn, und er wird zu einem Phyrexianer-Mensch-Kleriker mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 3/3.\\n{1}{B}{B}: Falls der Weiterentwickelte Schläfer ein Phyrexianer ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn. Dann ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574834&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '901b12b8-5bcc-4e2f-8647-8257b3520a70', 'multiverseId': 574834}, 'multiverseid': 574834}, {'name': 'Durmiente evolucionado', 'text': '{B}: El Durmiente evolucionado se convierte en un Clérigo Humano con fuerza y resistencia base de 2/2.\\n{1}{B}: Si el Durmiente evolucionado es un Clérigo, pon un contador de toque mortal sobre él. Se convierte en un Clérigo Humano Pirexiano con fuerza y resistencia base de 3/3.\\n{1}{B}{B}: Si el Durmiente evolucionado es un Pirexiano, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre él. Luego, robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575095&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea898cf1-b67b-4b3f-8e9c-2180e5535d80', 'multiverseId': 575095}, 'multiverseid': 575095}, {'name': 'Dormeur évolué', 'text': '{B} : Le Dormeur évolué devient un humain et clerc avec une force et une endurance de base de 2/2.\\n{1}{B} : Si le Dormeur évolué est un clerc, mettez un marqueur « Contact mortel » sur lui et il devient un phyrexian et humain et clerc avec une force et une endurance de base de 3/3.\\n{1}{B}{B} : Si le Dormeur évolué est un phyrexian, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui, puis vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.', 'type': 'Créature : humain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575356&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '163a7336-a427-4623-b09f-9ac41f181a9e', 'multiverseId': 575356}, 'multiverseid': 575356}, {'name': 'Dormiente Evoluto', 'text': '{B}: Il Dormiente Evoluto diventa un Chierico Umano con forza e costituzione base 2/2.\\n{1}{B}: Se il Dormiente Evoluto è un Chierico, metti un segnalino tocco letale su di esso e diventa un Chierico Umano Phyrexiano con forza e costituzione base 3/3.\\n{1}{B}{B}: Se il Dormiente Evoluto è un Phyrexiano, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di esso, poi peschi una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.', 'type': 'Creatura — Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575617&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '659c5644-6921-4938-81ca-54551cab630e', 'multiverseId': 575617}, 'multiverseid': 575617}, {'name': '進化した潜伏工作員', 'text': '{B}：進化した潜伏工作員は基本のパワーとタフネスが２/２の人間・クレリックになる。\\n{1}{B}：進化した潜伏工作員がクレリックであるなら、これの上に接死カウンター１個を置く。これは基本のパワーとタフネスが３/３のファイレクシアン・人間・クレリックになる。\\n{1}{B}{B}：進化した潜伏工作員がファイレクシアンであるなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。その後、あなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575878&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfe5d68f-529c-4ab7-ae98-773ec75e1092', 'multiverseId': 575878}, 'multiverseid': 575878}, {'name': 'Adormecido Evoluído', 'text': '{B}: Adormecido Evoluído torna-se um Humano Clérigo com poder e resistência básicos 2/2.\\n{1}{B}: Se Adormecido Evoluído for um Clérigo, coloque um marcador de toque mortífero nele e ele se torna um Phyrexiano Humano Clérigo com poder e resistência básicos 3/3.\\n{1}{B}{B}: Se Adormecido Evoluído for um Phyrexiano, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nele. Depois, você compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576400&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '351dd30e-879e-4884-868e-5463658df922', 'multiverseId': 576400}, 'multiverseid': 576400}, {'name': '进化潜探', 'text': '{B}：进化潜探成为基础力量与防御力为2/2的人类／僧侣。\\n{1}{B}：如果进化潜探是僧侣，则在其上放置一个死触指示物且它成为基础力量与防御力为3/3的非瑞人／人类／僧侣。\\n{1}{B}{B}：如果进化潜探是非瑞人，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。', 'type': '生物 ～人类', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576922&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83d20780-6676-4445-8e0c-33ceb9d4a05a', 'multiverseId': 576922}, 'multiverseid': 576922}]", "[{'name': 'Weiterentwickelter Schläfer', 'text': '{B}: Der Weiterentwickelte Schläfer wird zu einem Mensch-Kleriker mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 2/2.\\n{1}{B}: Falls der Weiterentwickelte Schläfer ein Kleriker ist, lege eine Todesberührung-Marke auf ihn, und er wird zu einem Phyrexianer-Mensch-Kleriker mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 3/3.\\n{1}{B}{B}: Falls der Weiterentwickelte Schläfer ein Phyrexianer ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn. Dann ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577557&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b118dde-5bfd-4e99-bce9-52f502e60220', 'multiverseId': 577557}, 'multiverseid': 577557}, {'name': 'Dormeur évolué', 'text': '{B} : Le Dormeur évolué devient un humain et clerc avec une force et une endurance de base de 2/2.\\n{1}{B} : Si le Dormeur évolué est un clerc, mettez un marqueur « Contact mortel » sur lui et il devient un phyrexian et humain et clerc avec une force et une endurance de base de 3/3.\\n{1}{B}{B} : Si le Dormeur évolué est un phyrexian, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui, puis vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.', 'type': 'Créature : humain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577597&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfa6afc8-1e58-46be-8828-37b90328aa34', 'multiverseId': 577597}, 'multiverseid': 577597}, {'name': '進化した潜伏工作員', 'text': '{B}：進化した潜伏工作員は基本のパワーとタフネスが２/２の人間・クレリックになる。\\n{1}{B}：進化した潜伏工作員がクレリックであるなら、これの上に接死カウンター１個を置く。これは基本のパワーとタフネスが３/３のファイレクシアン・人間・クレリックになる。\\n{1}{B}{B}：進化した潜伏工作員がファイレクシアンであるなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。その後、あなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577637&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64d0f240-3782-40d7-bcec-c2e9eb1e0fd1', 'multiverseId': 577637}, 'multiverseid': 577637}, {'name': '进化潜探', 'text': '{B}：进化潜探成为基础力量与防御力为2/2的人类／僧侣。\\n{1}{B}：如果进化潜探是僧侣，则在其上放置一个死触指示物且它成为基础力量与防御力为3/3的非瑞人／人类／僧侣。\\n{1}{B}{B}：如果进化潜探是非瑞人，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。', 'type': '生物 ～人类', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577677&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fb455c1-f003-4e57-82ae-aff44c2d2f17', 'multiverseId': 577677}, 'multiverseid': 577677}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wetterlicht, vollendet\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSolange auf der Wetterlicht, vollendet, vier oder mehr Phyresemarken liegen, ist sie zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen eine Phyrexianer-Kreatur.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, lege eine Phyresemarke auf die Wetterlicht, vollendet. Ziehe dann eine Karte, falls auf ihr sieben oder mehr Phyresemarken liegen. Anderenfalls wende Hellsicht 1 an.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb7d3b19-e9b6-47b7-b7be-1a235b5eec80\', \'multiverseId\': 574983}, \'multiverseid\': 574983}, {\'name\': \'Vientoligero perfeccionado\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMientras el Vientoligero perfeccionado tenga cuatro o más contadores de piresis sobre él, es una criatura Pirexiano además de sus otros tipos.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas muera, pon un contador de piresis sobre el Vientoligero perfeccionado. Luego roba una carta si tiene siete o más contadores de piresis sobre él. Si no, adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe907d02-7927-4dac-a002-ded6a73bb98a\', \'multiverseId\': 575244}, \'multiverseid\': 575244}, {\'name\': "L\'Aquilon parachevé", \'text\': \'Vol\\nTant que l\\\'Aquilon parachevé a au moins quatre marqueurs « phyrésie » sur lui, c\\\'est une créature Phyrexian en plus de ses autres types.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\\\'une créature que vous contrôlez meurt, mettez un marqueur « phyrésie » sur L\\\'Aquilon parachevé. Puis piochez une carte s\\\'il a au moins sept marqueurs "phyrésie" sur lui. Si ce n\\\'est pas le cas, regard 1.\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575505&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e25a492d-1413-404b-8a38-482647114ba5\', \'multiverseId\': 575505}, \'multiverseid\': 575505}, {\'name\': \'Cavalcavento Completata\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nFintanto che la Cavalcavento Completata ha quattro o più segnalini phyresis, è una creatura Phyrexiano in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli muore, metti un segnalino phyresis sulla Cavalcavento Completata. Poi pesca una carta se ha sette o più segnalini phyresis. Altrimenti, profetizza 1.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c1f5403-0953-4621-9b1e-92a213fc806b\', \'multiverseId\': 575766}, \'multiverseid\': 575766}, {\'name\': \'完成化したウェザーライト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n完成化したウェザーライトの上に４個以上のファイレクシア病・カウンターがあるかぎり、これはこれの他のタイプに加えてファイレクシアン・クリーチャーである。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、完成化したウェザーライトの上にファイレクシア病・カウンター１個を置く。その後、これの上に７個以上のファイレクシア病・カウンターがあるなら、カード１枚を引く。そうでないなら、占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e835f0cf-821f-4aeb-894e-3ea4c19006d0\', \'multiverseId\': 576027}, \'multiverseid\': 576027}, {\'name\': \'Bons Ventos Completado\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nEnquanto Bons Ventos Completado tiver quatro ou mais marcadores de phyresis, ele será uma criatura Phyrexiano além de seus outros tipos.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla morrer, coloque um marcador de phyresis em Bons Ventos Completado. Depois, compre um card se ele tiver sete ou mais marcadores de phyresis. Se não tiver, use vidência 1.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Veículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'938ad748-2794-44ed-aa88-a3ee005b8a02\', \'multiverseId\': 576549}, \'multiverseid\': 576549}, {\'name\': \'完化的晴空号\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n只要完化的晴空号上有四个或更多非瑞化指示物，它便是非瑞人生物，且仍具有原本类别。\\n每当一个由你操控的生物死去时，在完化的晴空号上放置一个非瑞化指示物。然后如果其上有七个或更多非瑞化指示物，则抓一张牌。若否，则占卜1。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e102188-aafc-483e-aa0b-657097f980b5\', \'multiverseId\': 577071}, \'multiverseid\': 577071}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wurzelweberin vom Juniperorden\', \'text\': \'Bonus {G} (Du kannst zusätzlich {G} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nWenn die Wurzelweberin vom Juniperorden ins Spiel kommt und falls ihre Bonuskosten bezahlt wurden, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Was Phyrexia nimmt, erneuert die Gnade von Freyalise."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574763&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d94a997f-aa18-4746-b4b5-19336ffd501b\', \'multiverseId\': 574763}, \'multiverseid\': 574763}, {\'name\': \'Tejerraíces de la Orden del Enebro\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {G}. (Puedes pagar {G} adicional al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nCuando la Tejerraíces de la Orden del Enebro entre al campo de batalla, si fue estimulada, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La gracia de Freyalise devuelve todo aquello que Pirexia arrebata".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e420cb0b-ed35-40a8-8e99-0e6f27f954fd\', \'multiverseId\': 575024}, \'multiverseid\': 575024}, {\'name\': "Tisseracines de l\'Ordre du genévrier", \'text\': "Kick {G} (Vous pouvez payer {G} supplémentaire au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nQuand la Tisseracines de l\'Ordre du genévrier arrive sur le champ de bataille, si elle a été kickée, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce que Phyrexia prend, la grâce de Freyalise restitue. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575285&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'841004e1-bbf8-431e-97d3-ca162c884561\', \'multiverseId\': 575285}, \'multiverseid\': 575285}, {\'name\': "Intrecciaradici dell\'Ordine di Juniper", \'text\': "Potenziamento {G} (Puoi pagare {G} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nQuando l\'Intrecciaradici dell\'Ordine di Juniper entra nel campo di battaglia, se è stata potenziata, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ciò che Phyrexia toglie, la grazia di Freyalise ripristina."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc074fd5-12db-48e0-9147-efd278a43483\', \'multiverseId\': 575546}, \'multiverseid\': 575546}, {\'name\': \'柏槙教団の樹根織り\', \'text\': \'キッカー{G}（この呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{G}を支払ってもよい。）\\n柏槙教団の樹根織りが戦場に出たとき、これがキッカーされていた場合、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「ファイレクシアが奪ったものは、フレイアリーズの恩寵が埋め合わせる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a56c0a5-f112-4aff-824e-7b0931d045e9\', \'multiverseId\': 575807}, \'multiverseid\': 575807}, {\'name\': \'Rizotecelã da Ordem do Zimbro\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {G} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {G} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nQuando Rizotecelã da Ordem do Zimbro entrar no campo de batalha, se ela foi reforçada, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"O que Phyrexia tomar, as graças de Freyalise devolverão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd9f7fb-a882-4705-9f44-87152c25c695\', \'multiverseId\': 576329}, \'multiverseid\': 576329}, {\'name\': \'杜松教派织根师\', \'text\': \'增幅{G}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{G}。)\\n当杜松教派织根师进战场时，若它已增幅，则在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「非瑞克西亚夺走的东西，在妃雅丽兹的辉映下会重现光芒。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4881a65e-e758-4359-ba69-3eb78dd3f08a\', \'multiverseId\': 576851}, \'multiverseid\': 576851}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wächterin von Neu-Benalia\', \'text\': \'Abkommandieren (Sowie diese Kreatur angreift, kannst du eine nicht angreifende Kreatur ohne Einsatzverzögerung, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Wenn du dies tust, addiere ihre Stärke bis zum Ende des Zuges zur Stärke dieser Kreatur.)\\nImmer wenn die Wächterin von Neu-Benalia eine Kreatur abkommandiert, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\\nWirf eine Karte ab: Die Wächterin von Neu-Benalia erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Tappe sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574760&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ef260a0-9ad0-4564-b324-69cbaf1998d9\', \'multiverseId\': 574760}, \'multiverseid\': 574760}, {\'name\': \'Guardiana de Nueva Benalia\', \'text\': \'Reclutar. (En cuanto esta criatura ataque, puedes girar una criatura que controlas sin mareo de invocación que no esté atacando. Cuando lo hagas, añade su fuerza a la de esta criatura hasta el final del turno.)\\nSiempre que la Guardiana de Nueva Benalia reclute una criatura, adivina 2.\\nDescartar una carta: La Guardiana de Nueva Benalia gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. Gírala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32eb4681-a84d-4f45-bdaa-72905330b098\', \'multiverseId\': 575021}, \'multiverseid\': 575021}, {\'name\': \'Vigile de la Nouvelle Bénalia\', \'text\': "Enrôlement (Au moment où cette créature attaque, vous pouvez engager une créature non-attaquante que vous contrôlez sans mal d\'invocation. Quand vous faites ainsi, ajoutez sa force à celle de cette créature jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Vigile de la Nouvelle Bénalia enrôle une créature, regard 2.\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte : La Vigile de la Nouvelle Bénalia acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Engagez-la.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575282&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b791084f-5fe8-427b-9dbc-c7a8f4499e93\', \'multiverseId\': 575282}, \'multiverseid\': 575282}, {\'name\': \'Guardiana di Nuova Benalia\', \'text\': \'Arruolare (Mentre questa creatura attacca, puoi TAPpare una creatura non attaccante che controlli non affetta da debolezza da evocazione. Quando lo fai, aggiungi la sua forza a quella di questa creatura fino alla fine del turno.)\\nOgniqualvolta la Guardiana di Nuova Benalia arruola una creatura, profetizza 2.\\nScarta una carta: La Guardiana di Nuova Benalia ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. TAPpala.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c755fb1-8288-4ed6-83b1-a804241fa5e4\', \'multiverseId\': 575543}, \'multiverseid\': 575543}, {\'name\': \'新ベナリアの守護者\', \'text\': \'後援（このクリーチャーが攻撃するに際し、あなたがコントロールしていて召喚酔いの影響を受けておらず攻撃してもいないクリーチャー１体をタップしてもよい。そうしたとき、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーのパワーにそのタップしたクリーチャーのパワーを足す。）\\n新ベナリアの守護者がクリーチャー１体に後援されるたび、占術２を行う。\\nカード１枚を捨てる：ターン終了時まで、新ベナリアの守護者は破壊不能を得る。これをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87f7533b-2c70-4cec-92b2-04288ebe897e\', \'multiverseId\': 575804}, \'multiverseid\': 575804}, {\'name\': \'Guardiã de Nova Benália\', \'text\': \'Alistar (Conforme esta criatura ataca, você pode virar uma criatura não atacante que você controla sem enjoo de invocação. Quando fizer isso, adicione o poder dela ao desta criatura até o final do turno.)\\nToda vez que Guardiã de Nova Benália alistar uma criatura, use vidência 2.\\nDescarte um card: Guardiã de Nova Benália ganha indestrutível até o final do turno. Vire-a.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb041cc1-6a95-4a67-959b-26825b799db9\', \'multiverseId\': 576326}, \'multiverseid\': 576326}, {\'name\': \'新宾纳里亚守护者\', \'text\': \'征列（于此生物攻击时，你可以横置一个由你操控、不具召唤失调且未进行攻击的生物。当你如此作时，将所横置生物的力量加至此生物直到回合结束。）\\n每当新宾纳里亚守护者征列生物时，占卜2。\\n弃一张牌：新宾纳里亚守护者获得不灭异能直到回合结束。将它横置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90c80ee1-f539-4d11-a544-c4e1b6cf8b18\', \'multiverseId\': 576848}, \'multiverseid\': 576848}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wächterin von Neu-Benalia\', \'text\': \'Abkommandieren\\nImmer wenn die Wächterin von Neu-Benalia eine Kreatur abkommandiert, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\\nWirf eine Karte ab: Die Wächterin von Neu-Benalia erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Tappe sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e676f49a-0cab-4863-9d16-183a71a209b6\', \'multiverseId\': 577541}, \'multiverseid\': 577541}, {\'name\': \'Vigile de la Nouvelle Bénalia\', \'text\': "Enrôlement\\nÀ chaque fois que la Vigile de la Nouvelle Bénalia enrôle une créature, regard 2.\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte : La Vigile de la Nouvelle Bénalia acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Engagez-la.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d954fd-922a-4bc7-951c-7ed9a8ea9fbe\', \'multiverseId\': 577581}, \'multiverseid\': 577581}, {\'name\': \'新ベナリアの守護者\', \'text\': \'後援\\n新ベナリアの守護者がクリーチャー１体に後援されるたび、占術２を行う。\\nカード１枚を捨てる：ターン終了時まで、新ベナリアの守護者は破壊不能を得る。これをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f088546-3415-4c2a-98ad-fa022aaa2022\', \'multiverseId\': 577621}, \'multiverseid\': 577621}, {\'name\': \'新宾纳里亚守护者\', \'text\': \'征列\\n每当新宾纳里亚守护者征列生物时，占卜2。\\n弃一张牌：新宾纳里亚守护者获得不灭异能直到回合结束。将它横置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b96151c8-66b0-4cf9-a0f4-2af0e1544e99\', \'multiverseId\': 577661}, \'multiverseid\': 577661}]', '[{\'name\': \'Würgendes Miasma\', \'text\': \'Bonus {G} (Du kannst zusätzlich {G} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nFalls die Bonuskosten dieses Zauberspruchs bezahlt wurden, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\\nAlle Kreaturen erhalten -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Phyrexianer stellten überrascht fest, dass sie immer noch Atemluft benötigten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574827&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69c6b1ed-7e15-4542-a6f7-8bf39ec33cb1\', \'multiverseId\': 574827}, \'multiverseid\': 574827}, {\'name\': \'Miasma asfixiante\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {G}. (Puedes pagar {G} adicional al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nSi este hechizo fue estimulado, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controlas.\\nTodas las criaturas obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La sorpresa de los pirexianos fue tan grande como la de los demás cuando se dieron cuenta de que ellos también necesitaban respirar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a67da00-e659-4951-a54d-8e73da913d92\', \'multiverseId\': 575088}, \'multiverseid\': 575088}, {\'name\': \'Miasmes étouffants\', \'text\': "Kick {G} (Vous pouvez payer {G} supplémentaire au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nSi ce sort a été kické, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature que vous contrôlez.\\nToutes les créatures gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les Phyrexians furent surpris de découvrir qu\'ils devaient encore respirer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575349&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb6215f7-ce9f-4d29-891f-4fab73a3e47a\', \'multiverseId\': 575349}, \'multiverseid\': 575349}, {\'name\': \'Miasma Soffocante\', \'text\': \'Potenziamento {G} (Puoi pagare {G} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nSe questa magia è stata potenziata, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura che controlli.\\nTutte le creature prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I Phyrexiani stessi si sorpresero quando scoprirono che avevano ancora bisogno di respirare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3acd6ff4-0f58-4dfc-9487-e7fd354660e4\', \'multiverseId\': 575610}, \'multiverseid\': 575610}, {\'name\': \'締めつける瘴気\', \'text\': \'キッカー{G}（この呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{G}を支払ってもよい。）\\nこの呪文がキッカーされていたなら、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nターン終了時まで、すべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ファイレクシア人は、いまだに呼吸が必要だということに驚いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'198c1156-4ea8-4b9e-8e33-3c576595f002\', \'multiverseId\': 575871}, \'multiverseid\': 575871}, {\'name\': \'Miasma Estrangulador\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {G} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {G} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nSe esta mágica foi reforçada, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em uma criatura que você controla.\\nTodas as criaturas recebem -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os phyrexianos ficaram tão surpresos quanto qualquer um ao descobrir que ainda precisavam respirar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb32f885-8324-435c-92f7-5652ed04e4f1\', \'multiverseId\': 576393}, \'multiverseid\': 576393}, {\'name\': \'窒息沼气\', \'text\': \'增幅{G}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{G}。)\\n如果此咒语已增幅，则在一个由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n所有生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'非瑞克西亚人同样错愕地发现，自己依然需要呼吸。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bc355ce-6307-4612-b5c5-b3b45223659f\', \'multiverseId\': 576915}, \'multiverseid\': 576915}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wütendes Gebrüll\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+0 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges. Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Minotauren täuschen manchmal vor, blind vor Kampfwut zu sein, damit ihre Gegner ihre Schläue unterschätzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574867&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ca9fc0-2a96-44c3-b595-4a951c0e6570\', \'multiverseId\': 574867}, \'multiverseid\': 574867}, {\'name\': \'Clamor furioso\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno. Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En ocasiones, los minotauros fingen sufrir un arrebato de furia en la batalla para que sus adversarios subestimen su inteligencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae2582f3-c2d5-4b81-9add-e775c3f19f09\', \'multiverseId\': 575128}, \'multiverseid\': 575128}, {\'name\': \'Beuglement furieux\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +3/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les minotaures font parfois semblant d\'être pris d\'une rage de combat pour que leurs adversaires sous-estiment leur intelligence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575389&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'762ac3b1-e5d3-408f-846b-ac2a99e4d464\', \'multiverseId\': 575389}, \'multiverseid\': 575389}, {\'name\': \'Ruggito Furioso\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+0 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno. Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Talvolta i minotauri fingono di essere pervasi dalla furia della battaglia, portando gli avversari a sottovalutare la loro astuzia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d956789-45e4-4216-806c-1d471f4e4474\', \'multiverseId\': 575650}, \'multiverseid\': 575650}, {\'name\': \'猛然たる怒声\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋０の修整を受け先制攻撃を得る。占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ミノタウルスは激闘の中で我を失ったかのようにみせかけ、相手が賢さを見くびるよう誘うことがある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5ba7c7d-4c47-4439-8eef-670165ec2836\', \'multiverseId\': 575911}, \'multiverseid\': 575911}, {\'name\': \'Brado Furioso\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+0 e ganha iniciativa até o final do turno. Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Às vezes, os minotauros fingem estar perdidos na fúria da batalha, levando os oponentes a subestimar sua sagacidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'000ac0a5-0b55-42ca-aeef-307700ad0402\', \'multiverseId\': 576433}, \'multiverseid\': 576433}, {\'name\': \'怒火狂嚎\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+3/+0且获得先攻异能。占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'牛头怪有时会假装因战怒而失控，好让对手误认他们只是一群莽夫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'970b7d5d-7366-41bb-9683-0e8667dc1fbd\', \'multiverseId\': 576955}, \'multiverseid\': 576955}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yavimaya-Ikonoklastin\', \'text\': \'Bonus {R} (Du kannst zusätzlich {R} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn die Yavimaya-Ikonoklastin ins Spiel kommt und falls ihre Bonuskosten bezahlt wurden, erhält sie +1/+1 und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf\', \'flavor\': \'Waffen aus Stahl üben auf einige der jüngeren Yavimayaner den Reiz des Verbotenen aus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4e64bae-2fb2-47f7-8e44-97e51945bd0a\', \'multiverseId\': 574931}, \'multiverseid\': 574931}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclasta de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {R}. (Puedes pagar {R} adicional al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nArrolla.\\nCuando la Iconoclasta de Yavimaya entre al campo de batalla, si fue estimulada, obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Las armas de acero despiertan una fascinación prohibida en algunos jóvenes de Yavimaya.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39dce91b-077a-4f05-ad91-9b57553a8d90\', \'multiverseId\': 575192}, \'multiverseid\': 575192}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclaste de la Yavimaya\', \'text\': "Kick {R} (Vous pouvez payer {R} supplémentaire au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nPiétinement\\nQuand l\'Iconoclaste de la Yavimaya arrive sur le champ de bataille, s\'il a été kické, il gagne +1/+1 et acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe\', \'flavor\': "Les armes en acier ont l\'attrait de l\'interdit pour certains des Yavimayans les plus jeunes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8844e077-286d-4822-b998-25b4f7770672\', \'multiverseId\': 575453}, \'multiverseid\': 575453}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclasta di Yavimaya\', \'text\': "Potenziamento {R} (Puoi pagare {R} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nTravolgere\\nQuando l\'Iconoclasta di Yavimaya entra nel campo di battaglia, se è stata potenziata, prende +1/+1 e ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': "Le armi d\'acciaio esercitano un fascino proibito sui più giovani di Yavimaya.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7aa7908-acf5-4466-ae86-b01bd6db6a49\', \'multiverseId\': 575714}, \'multiverseid\': 575714}, {\'name\': \'ヤヴィマヤの偶像破壊者\', \'text\': \'キッカー{R}（この呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{R}を支払ってもよい。）\\nトランプル\\nヤヴィマヤの偶像破壊者が戦場に出たとき、これがキッカーされていた場合、ターン終了時まで、これは＋１/＋１の修整を受け速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ\', \'flavor\': \'鋼の武器は一部の若いヤヴィマヤの民にとって禁断の誘惑である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea51e4b-6002-4a3b-8fad-d8b884f84eb8\', \'multiverseId\': 575975}, \'multiverseid\': 575975}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclasta de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {R} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {R} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nAtropelar\\nQuando Iconoclasta de Yavimaya entra no campo de batalha, se ela foi reforçada, ela recebe +1/+1 e ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'As armas de aço têm um fascínio proibido para alguns yavimayanos mais jovens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec03af6-a4f3-4de0-b403-81b5690dacf4\', \'multiverseId\': 576497}, \'multiverseid\': 576497}, {\'name\': \'亚维马雅反逆妖精\', \'text\': \'增幅{R}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{R}。）\\n践踏\\n当亚维马雅反逆妖精进战场时，若它已增幅，则直到回合结束，它得+1/+1且获得敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精\', \'flavor\': \'一些年轻的亚维马雅人经不住钢铁兵器的禁忌诱惑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa8b250b-8959-46da-8901-9fd1e4725bb7\', \'multiverseId\': 577019}, \'multiverseid\': 577019}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yavimaya-Stahlmalmer\', \'text\': \'Abkommandieren (Sowie diese Kreatur angreift, kannst du eine nicht angreifende Kreatur ohne Einsatzverzögerung, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Wenn du dies tust, addiere ihre Stärke bis zum Ende des Zuges zur Stärke dieser Kreatur.)\\n{1}, opfere den Yavimaya-Stahlmalmer: Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Menschenaffe, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574893&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b72b6f5-8e99-453d-abb9-c621012c5224\', \'multiverseId\': 574893}, \'multiverseid\': 574893}, {\'name\': \'Trituracero de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Reclutar. (En cuanto esta criatura ataque, puedes girar una criatura que controlas sin mareo de invocación que no esté atacando. Cuando lo hagas, añade su fuerza a la de esta criatura hasta el final del turno.)\\n{1}, sacrificar el Trituracero de Yavimaya: Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero simio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e26bf6c-b79d-412b-b38a-2d3d4822d76a\', \'multiverseId\': 575154}, \'multiverseid\': 575154}, {\'name\': "Écrabouilleur d\'acier de la Yavimaya", \'text\': "Enrôlement (Au moment où cette créature attaque, vous pouvez engager une créature non-attaquante que vous contrôlez sans mal d\'invocation. Quand vous faites ainsi, ajoutez sa force à celle de cette créature jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\n{1}, sacrifiez l\'Écrabouilleur d\'acier de la Yavimaya : Détruisez un artefact ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : grand singe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575415&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc90734d-075e-4dcf-8173-3b2d69a78928\', \'multiverseId\': 575415}, \'multiverseid\': 575415}, {\'name\': \'Frantumacciaio di Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Arruolare (Mentre questa creatura attacca, puoi TAPpare una creatura non attaccante che controlli non affetta da debolezza da evocazione. Quando lo fai, aggiungi la sua forza a quella di questa creatura fino alla fine del turno.)\\n{1}, Sacrifica il Frantumacciaio di Yavimaya: Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Scimpanzé\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e767ea6b-5be7-4229-bdcb-27c067b57dab\', \'multiverseId\': 575676}, \'multiverseid\': 575676}, {\'name\': \'ヤヴィマヤの鋼潰し\', \'text\': \'後援（このクリーチャーが攻撃するに際し、あなたがコントロールしていて召喚酔いの影響を受けておらず攻撃してもいないクリーチャー１体をタップしてもよい。そうしたとき、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーのパワーにそのタップしたクリーチャーのパワーを足す。）\\n{1},ヤヴィマヤの鋼潰しを生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 類人猿・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24ab2771-64b9-4e9b-9c0a-376917f0e105\', \'multiverseId\': 575937}, \'multiverseid\': 575937}, {\'name\': \'Esmagador de Aço de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'Alistar (Conforme esta criatura ataca, você pode virar uma criatura não atacante que você controla sem enjoo de invocação. Quando fizer isso, adicione o poder dela ao desta criatura até o final do turno.)\\n{1}, sacrifique Esmagador de Aço de Yavimaya: Destrua o artefato alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Símio Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6dbc270-68ab-43c4-8ea6-f5ef1880a8ad\', \'multiverseId\': 576459}, \'multiverseid\': 576459}, {\'name\': \'亚维马雅碎钢猿\', \'text\': \'征列（于此生物攻击时，你可以横置一个由你操控、不具召唤失调且未进行攻击的生物。当你如此作时，将所横置生物的力量加至此生物直到回合结束。）\\n{1}，牺牲亚维马雅碎钢猿：消灭目标神器。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猿猴／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f2fda8-e8c5-4c01-8463-bd4a75dfbceb\', \'multiverseId\': 576981}, \'multiverseid\': 576981}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yavimayaküste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}. Die Yavimayaküste fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Als sich Magnigoth-Bäume über das Meer nach Almaaz und Neu-Argivia ausbreiteten, wurde klar, dass die Grenzen von Yavimaya noch nie durch seine Küstenlinie bestimmt wurden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da8ad092-263b-4883-ba0b-192a7f0e5c75\', \'multiverseId\': 575002}, \'multiverseid\': 575002}, {\'name\': \'Costa de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}. La Costa de Yavimaya te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'A medida que los árboles mágnigoth atravesaban el mar para llegar a Almaaz y Nueva Argivia, quedó claro que la costa de Yavimaya nunca restringió sus fronteras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23ff7a64-a431-4f19-ad88-23f70f859b04\', \'multiverseId\': 575263}, \'multiverseid\': 575263}, {\'name\': \'Côte de la Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}. La Côte de la Yavimaya vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Tandis que les magnigoths se répandaient au-delà de la mer en Almaaz et en Nouvelle Argive, il devint clair que les frontières de la Yavimaya n\'étaient pas confinées à ses côtes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b85bc1f2-dfcc-41b8-9dbf-6f5bad671b91\', \'multiverseId\': 575524}, \'multiverseid\': 575524}, {\'name\': \'Costa di Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}. La Costa di Yavimaya ti infligge 1 danno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Man mano che gli alberi di magnigoth si espandevano attraverso il mare verso Almaaz e Nuova Argivia, divenne chiaro che i confini di Yavimaya non erano mai stati limitati dalla sua costa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ef629be-bd0e-45bf-8cb0-3e3e29b967d5\', \'multiverseId\': 575785}, \'multiverseid\': 575785}, {\'name\': \'ヤヴィマヤの沿岸\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。ヤヴィマヤの沿岸はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'マグニゴスの樹々が海を渡りアルマーズや新アルガイヴまで拡大すると、ヤヴィマヤの境界線が海岸によって区切られていないということが明らかになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e34a7ca3-6aff-4f37-93d7-6f9e70b00e73\', \'multiverseId\': 576046}, \'multiverseid\': 576046}, {\'name\': \'Costa de Yavimaya\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}. Costa de Yavimaya causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme as árvores de magnigote se expandiram além-mar para Almaaz e o Novo Argivo, ficou claro que as fronteiras de Yavimaya jamais foram limitadas a seu litoral.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'508b9d7c-cd1f-4feb-9d55-20f7c8d3ffcd\', \'multiverseId\': 576568}, \'multiverseid\': 576568}, {\'name\': \'亚维马雅海岸\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。亚维马雅海岸对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'随着马尼古斯树穿越大海扎根阿玛兹和新阿基夫，大家方才醒悟亚维马雅的边界绝不会受海岸束缚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5858ac5-bc46-4788-8294-2d689522e389\', \'multiverseId\': 577090}, \'multiverseid\': 577090}]', "[{'name': 'Yavimayaküste', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}. Die Yavimayaküste fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577374&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abb0824a-af9d-4262-83df-7b5f16c6229b', 'multiverseId': 577374}, 'multiverseid': 577374}, {'name': 'Costa de Yavimaya', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}. La Costa de Yavimaya te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577380&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89f12651-7f74-442a-931b-b0aeb5870798', 'multiverseId': 577380}, 'multiverseid': 577380}, {'name': 'Côte de la Yavimaya', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}. La Côte de la Yavimaya vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577386&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '933fef3b-a958-4bd1-a0b8-0ebcf6d55320', 'multiverseId': 577386}, 'multiverseid': 577386}, {'name': 'Costa di Yavimaya', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}. La Costa di Yavimaya ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577392&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c199da14-ef71-441a-a1e8-a2421c001b71', 'multiverseId': 577392}, 'multiverseid': 577392}, {'name': 'ヤヴィマヤの沿岸', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。ヤヴィマヤの沿岸はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577398&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '709999a6-28e6-4afc-a1a1-3971d75096ed', 'multiverseId': 577398}, 'multiverseid': 577398}, {'name': 'Costa de Yavimaya', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}. Costa de Yavimaya causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577410&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9c67d82-5fa0-431d-86cf-bb8c9517e459', 'multiverseId': 577410}, 'multiverseid': 577410}, {'name': '亚维马雅海岸', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。亚维马雅海岸对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577422&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b67a199e-30f1-47cb-b0eb-9c1b279dae46', 'multiverseId': 577422}, 'multiverseid': 577422}]", '[{\'name\': \'Yotia erklärt den Krieg\', \'text\': \'Überblättern (Wähle ein Kapitel und beginne mit so vielen Sagenmarken. Füge nach deinem Ziehsegment eine hinzu. Übersprungene Kapitel werden nicht ausgelöst. Opfern nach III.)\\nI — Erzeuge einen 0/2 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit namens Ornithopter.\\nII — Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl ungetappter Artefakte, die du kontrollierst. Wenn du dies tust, fügt Yotia erklärt den Krieg einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\\nIII — Bis zu ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 4/4.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Sage\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574894&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41b2e74-cff0-4c01-b825-64be283dc959\', \'multiverseId\': 574894}, \'multiverseid\': 574894}, {\'name\': \'Yotia declara la guerra\', \'text\': \'Adelanto. (Elige un capítulo y empieza con esa misma cantidad de contadores de sabiduría. Añade uno después de tu paso de robar. Los capítulos omitidos no se disparan. Sacrifica esta Saga después de III.)\\nI — Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 0/2 con la habilidad de volar llamada Ornitóptero.\\nII — Gira cualquier cantidad de artefactos enderezados que controlas. Cuando lo hagas, Yotia declara la guerra hace esa misma cantidad de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\\nIII — Hasta un artefacto objetivo que controlas se convierte en una criatura con fuerza y resistencia base de 4/4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd1270e0-37d5-45f9-912a-8929d4677dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 575155}, \'multiverseid\': 575155}, {\'name\': \'Yotia déclare la guerre\', \'text\': "Lecture rapide (Choisissez un chapitre et commencez avec autant de marqueurs « sapience ». Ajoutez-en un après votre étape de pioche. Les chapitres passés ne se déclenchent pas. Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI — Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 0/2 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol appelé Ornithoptère.\\nII — Engagez n\'importe quel nombre d\'artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez. Quand vous faites ainsi, Yotia déclare la guerre inflige autant de blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\\nIII — Jusqu\'à un artefact ciblé que vous contrôlez devient une créature ayant une force et une endurance de base de 4/4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575416&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90e8b70e-01a6-4e49-9bf4-05275fcfe0f9\', \'multiverseId\': 575416}, \'multiverseid\': 575416}, {\'name\': \'Yotia Dichiara Guerra\', \'text\': \'Saltare pagina (Scegli un capitolo e inizia con quel numero di segnalini sapere. Aggiungine uno dopo la tua acquisizione. I capitoli saltati non si innescano. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI — Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 0/2 incolore con volare chiamata Ornitottero.\\nII — TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di artefatti STAPpati che controlli. Quando lo fai, Yotia Dichiara Guerra infligge altrettanti danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\nIII — Fino a un artefatto bersaglio che controlli diventa una creatura con forza e costituzione base 4/4 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbb27c38-b1f4-4d95-bde6-affc8c36f2e7\', \'multiverseId\': 575677}, \'multiverseid\': 575677}, {\'name\': \'ヨーティアの宣戦布告\', \'text\': \'先読（章を選び、それに等しい数の伝承カウンターで始める。あなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を追加する。飛ばされた章は誘発しない。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI — 「羽ばたき飛行機械」という名前で飛行を持つ無色の０/２の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nII — あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である望む数のアーティファクトをタップする。そうしたとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。これはそれに、そのタップしたアーティファクトの数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\nIII ― あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト最大１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは基本のパワーとタフネスが４/４のアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — 英雄譚\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec4d5dc-4bb4-448c-87f7-1f0ef8a41929\', \'multiverseId\': 575938}, \'multiverseid\': 575938}, {\'name\': \'Yotia Declara Guerra\', \'text\': \'Adiantar leitura (Escolha um capítulo e comece com aquela quantidade de marcadores de conhecimento. Adicione um após sua etapa de compra. Os capítulos pulados não são desencadeados. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI — Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Tóptero incolor 0/2 com voar com o nome Ornitóptero.\\nII — Vire qualquer número de artefatos desvirados que você controla. Quando faz isso, Yotia Declara Guerra causa aquela quantidade de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo.\\nIII — Até um artefato alvo que você controla se torna uma criatura com poder e resistência básicos 4/4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Saga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d448a72-4721-4edc-9da6-82efefdd2ecd\', \'multiverseId\': 576460}, \'multiverseid\': 576460}, {\'name\': \'佑天宣战史\', \'text\': \'跳读（选择一个章节，此传纪一开始就有该数量的学问指示物。于你抓牌步骤后再加一个。跳过的章节不会触发。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI — 派出一个0/2无色，名称为扑翼机，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\\nII — 横置任意数量由你操控且未横置的神器。当你如此作时，佑天宣战史对目标生物或鹏洛客造成等量的伤害。\\nIII — 至多一个目标由你操控的神器成为基础力量与防御力为4/4的生物直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～传纪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb639da-eb1d-4d13-97f2-79463eee4eda\', \'multiverseId\': 576982}, \'multiverseid\': 576982}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zar Ojanen, Tochter von Efrava\', \'text\': \'Domäne — Immer wenn Zar Ojanen, Tochter von Efrava, getappt wird, lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und deren Widerstandskraft kleiner ist als die Anzahl an Standardlandtypen unter den Ländern, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich trage meine Heimat in meinem Herzen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ce261a8-f4c5-46b7-a25f-4879b58e3996\', \'multiverseId\': 574968}, \'multiverseid\': 574968}, {\'name\': \'Zar Ojanen, hija de Efrava\', \'text\': \'Dominio — Siempre que Zar Ojanen, hija de Efrava se gire, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas con una resistencia menor que la cantidad de tipos de tierra básica entre las tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Llevo mi hogar en el corazón".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a59f09ca-e200-4294-ac57-17e89d7bea55\', \'multiverseId\': 575229}, \'multiverseid\': 575229}, {\'name\': "Zar Ojanen, scion d\'Efrava", \'text\': "Domaine — À chaque fois que Zar Ojanen, scion d\'Efrava devient engagé, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez avec une endurance inférieure au nombre de types de terrain de base parmi les terrains que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Je porte mon foyer dans mon cœur. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575490&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96d435f6-093f-4f6e-b8e6-1ad3c05c2120\', \'multiverseId\': 575490}, \'multiverseid\': 575490}, {\'name\': \'Zar Ojanen, Erede di Efrava\', \'text\': \'Dominio — Ogniqualvolta Zar Ojanen, Erede di Efrava viene TAPpata, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli con costituzione inferiore al numero di tipi di terra base tra le terre che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Porto la mia terra nel mio cuore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f151c770-259c-42d9-b444-db9f2e7295c0\', \'multiverseId\': 575751}, \'multiverseid\': 575751}, {\'name\': \'エフラヴァの末裔、ザー・オジャネン\', \'text\': \'版図 — エフラヴァの末裔、ザー・オジャネンがタップ状態になるたび、あなたがコントロールしていてタフネスがあなたがコントロールしている土地の中の基本土地タイプの種類数より小さい各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「私の心にも故郷がある。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'517aa07e-0b68-434b-a37c-cbc835f226c7\', \'multiverseId\': 576012}, \'multiverseid\': 576012}, {\'name\': \'Zar Ojanen, Descendente de Efrava\', \'text\': \'Dominar — Toda vez que Zar Ojanen, Descendente de Efrava, tornar-se virada, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla com resistência inferior ao número de tipos de terreno básico entre os terrenos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Felino Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu carrego meu lar no coração."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'732d073b-1c74-4653-9b0d-b63f3758e105\', \'multiverseId\': 576534}, \'multiverseid\': 576534}, {\'name\': \'依法瓦传人札娅欧亚奈\', \'text\': \'领土～每当依法瓦传人札娅欧亚奈成为横置时，计算由你操控之地中基本地类别的数量，在每个由你操控且防御力小于该数值的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「家乡随时都在我心里。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86ffd32c-d73f-45bd-896f-522f66395b61\', \'multiverseId\': 577056}, \'multiverseid\': 577056}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zar Ojanen, Tochter von Efrava\', \'text\': \'Domäne — Immer wenn Zar Ojanen, Tochter von Efrava, getappt wird, lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und deren Widerstandskraft kleiner ist als die Anzahl an Standardlandtypen unter den Ländern, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577913&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe36b878-02c4-4347-a987-c1d98de8c3c0\', \'multiverseId\': 577913}, \'multiverseid\': 577913}, {\'name\': "Zar Ojanen, scion d\'Efrava", \'text\': "Domaine — À chaque fois que Zar Ojanen, scion d\'Efrava devient engagé, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez avec une endurance inférieure au nombre de types de terrain de base parmi les terrains que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577954&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'308e71c6-67d8-4b06-b6ea-d019f2c38768\', \'multiverseId\': 577954}, \'multiverseid\': 577954}, {\'name\': \'エフラヴァの末裔、ザー・オジャネン\', \'text\': \'版図 — エフラヴァの末裔、ザー・オジャネンがタップ状態になるたび、あなたがコントロールしていてタフネスがあなたがコントロールしている土地の中の基本土地タイプの種類数より小さい各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd287464-a5e6-4396-bbb5-a7be565c98ad\', \'multiverseId\': 577995}, \'multiverseid\': 577995}, {\'name\': \'依法瓦传人札娅欧亚奈\', \'text\': \'领土～每当依法瓦传人札娅欧亚奈成为横置时，计算由你操控之地中基本地类别的数量，在每个由你操控且防御力小于该数值的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6687484e-ffd1-466d-b2e1-fc7c6d9d6e59\', \'multiverseId\': 578036}, \'multiverseid\': 578036}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zar Ojanen, Tochter von Efrava\', \'text\': \'Domäne — Immer wenn Zar Ojanen, Tochter von Efrava, getappt wird, lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und deren Widerstandskraft kleiner ist als die Anzahl an Standardlandtypen unter den Ländern, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578120&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8705fb0c-d298-44ff-8932-3ac5734a99fb\', \'multiverseId\': 578120}, \'multiverseid\': 578120}, {\'name\': \'Zar Ojanen, hija de Efrava\', \'text\': \'Dominio — Siempre que Zar Ojanen, hija de Efrava se gire, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas con una resistencia menor que la cantidad de tipos de tierra básica entre las tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a12b1cd-96a6-426c-8e63-662bf09fc4db\', \'multiverseId\': 578161}, \'multiverseid\': 578161}, {\'name\': "Zar Ojanen, scion d\'Efrava", \'text\': "Domaine — À chaque fois que Zar Ojanen, scion d\'Efrava devient engagé, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez avec une endurance inférieure au nombre de types de terrain de base parmi les terrains que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578202&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f170b46d-2d07-47bc-82a3-1ebfae97d475\', \'multiverseId\': 578202}, \'multiverseid\': 578202}, {\'name\': \'Zar Ojanen, Erede di Efrava\', \'text\': \'Dominio — Ogniqualvolta Zar Ojanen, Erede di Efrava viene TAPpata, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli con costituzione inferiore al numero di tipi di terra base tra le terre che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'091f7b34-3d14-46d4-99e2-29d9d3069f25\', \'multiverseId\': 578243}, \'multiverseid\': 578243}, {\'name\': \'エフラヴァの末裔、ザー・オジャネン\', \'text\': \'版図 — エフラヴァの末裔、ザー・オジャネンがタップ状態になるたび、あなたがコントロールしていてタフネスがあなたがコントロールしている土地の中の基本土地タイプの種類数より小さい各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df4e711f-e047-498d-80f8-48c325c3e0f9\', \'multiverseId\': 578284}, \'multiverseid\': 578284}, {\'name\': \'Zar Ojanen, Descendente de Efrava\', \'text\': \'Dominar — Toda vez que Zar Ojanen, Descendente de Efrava, tornar-se virada, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla com resistência inferior ao número de tipos de terreno básico entre os terrenos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Felino Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'528826d4-4fed-4395-adb7-a0988a418ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 578366}, \'multiverseid\': 578366}, {\'name\': \'依法瓦传人札娅欧亚奈\', \'text\': \'领土～每当依法瓦传人札娅欧亚奈成为横置时，计算由你操控之地中基本地类别的数量，在每个由你操控且防御力小于该数值的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'001af54e-d5e1-46a6-9574-f91f08fe44e3\', \'multiverseId\': 578448}, \'multiverseid\': 578448}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zauberbann-Schildkröte\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {2} (Immer wenn diese Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {2}.)\\nAbkommandieren (Sowie diese Kreatur angreift, kannst du eine nicht angreifende Kreatur ohne Einsatzverzögerung, die du kontrollierst, tappen. Wenn du dies tust, addiere ihre Stärke bis zum Ende des Zuges zur Stärke dieser Kreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schildkröte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574907&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0625440-625f-48d8-b24f-f236c6ddd2b9\', \'multiverseId\': 574907}, \'multiverseid\': 574907}, {\'name\': \'Tortuga suprimemaleficios\', \'text\': \'Rebatir {2}. (Siempre que esta criatura sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarréstalo a menos que ese jugador pague {2}.)\\nReclutar. (En cuanto esta criatura ataque, puedes girar una criatura que controlas sin mareo de invocación que no esté atacando. Cuando lo hagas, añade su fuerza a la de esta criatura hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tortuga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3160ed32-bf60-4d70-bdb9-2deb817b555d\', \'multiverseId\': 575168}, \'multiverseid\': 575168}, {\'name\': \'Tortue fléau des maléfices\', \'text\': "Parade {2} (À chaque fois que cette créature devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {2}.)\\nEnrôlement (Au moment où cette créature attaque, vous pouvez engager une créature non-attaquante que vous contrôlez sans mal d\'invocation. Quand vous faites ainsi, ajoutez sa force à celle de cette créature jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : tortue terrestre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575429&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1e12a81-762b-4b0a-9ed5-8883cf1e38cf\', \'multiverseId\': 575429}, \'multiverseid\': 575429}, {\'name\': \'Testuggine Repellimagia\', \'text\': \'Egida {2} (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {2}.)\\nArruolare (Mentre questa creatura attacca, puoi TAPpare una creatura non attaccante che controlli non affetta da debolezza da evocazione. Quando lo fai, aggiungi la sua forza a quella di questa creatura fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tartaruga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87357ae1-2f0b-4330-b8c0-24c14e121bf1\', \'multiverseId\': 575690}, \'multiverseid\': 575690}, {\'name\': \'呪詛消しの亀\', \'text\': \'護法{2}（このクリーチャーが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\\n後援（このクリーチャーが攻撃するに際し、あなたがコントロールしていて召喚酔いの影響を受けておらず攻撃してもいないクリーチャー１体をタップしてもよい。そうしたとき、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーのパワーにそのタップしたクリーチャーのパワーを足す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 海亀\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4aecdc8-2693-4241-bf6d-c3a59dbd3c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 575951}, \'multiverseid\': 575951}, {\'name\': \'Jabuti Antibruxaria\', \'text\': \'Salvaguarda {2} (Toda vez que esta criatura se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, anule-a, a menos que aquele jogador pague {2}.)\\nAlistar (Conforme esta criatura ataca, você pode virar uma criatura não atacante que você controla sem enjoo de invocação. Quando fizer isso, adicione o poder dela ao desta criatura até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tartaruga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de47a41f-05e7-4225-bedd-f132417165a6\', \'multiverseId\': 576473}, \'multiverseid\': 576473}, {\'name\': \'禁邪龟\', \'text\': \'守护{2}（每当此生物成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该牌手支付{2}，否则反击之。）\\n征列（于此生物攻击时，你可以横置一个由你操控、不具召唤失调且未进行攻击的生物。当你如此作时，将所横置生物的力量加至此生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a44770e1-3689-461e-8903-c93e3f51fc7f\', \'multiverseId\': 576995}, \'multiverseid\': 576995}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zeit schinden\', \'text\': \'Bonus {1}{U} (Du kannst zusätzlich {1}{U} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nTappe bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl. Falls die Bonuskosten dieses Zauberspruchs bezahlt wurden, lege auf jede der Kreaturen eine Betäubungsmarke. (Falls eine bleibende Karte mit Betäubungsmarke enttappt würde, entferne stattdessen eine davon.)\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574775&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f09db73-83a5-4cee-827b-06486123edce\', \'multiverseId\': 574775}, \'multiverseid\': 574775}, {\'name\': \'Ganar tiempo\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {1}{U}. (Puedes pagar {1}{U} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nGira hasta dos criaturas objetivo. Si este hechizo fue estimulado, pon un contador de aturdimiento sobre cada una de esas criaturas. (Si un permanente con un contador de aturdimiento fuera a enderezarse, en vez de eso, remueve uno de esos contadores de él.)\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f26c7d16-d8fb-4d74-afe2-788343ca86a8\', \'multiverseId\': 575036}, \'multiverseid\': 575036}, {\'name\': \'Gagner du temps\', \'text\': "Kick {1}{U} (Vous pouvez payer {1}{U} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nEngagez jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées. Si ce sort a été kické, mettez un marqueur « étourdissement » sur chacune de ces créatures. (Si un permanent avec un marqueur « étourdissement » devait devenir dégagé, retirez-lui en un à la place.)\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575297&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60b8e449-b3c4-4eb1-9460-1983f2f9af03\', \'multiverseId\': 575297}, \'multiverseid\': 575297}, {\'name\': \'Temporeggiare\', \'text\': \'Potenziamento {1}{U} (Puoi pagare {1}{U} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nTAPpa fino a due creature bersaglio. Se questa magia è stata potenziata, metti un segnalino stordimento su ognuna di quelle creature. (Se un permanente con un segnalino stordimento sta per essere STAPpato, rimuovi invece un segnalino stordimento da esso.)\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a32c1cf5-d6c3-4cb9-af4f-4e4fa000b927\', \'multiverseId\': 575558}, \'multiverseid\': 575558}, {\'name\': \'時間稼ぎ\', \'text\': \'キッカー{1}{U}（この呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}{U}を支払ってもよい。）\\nクリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらをタップする。この呪文がキッカーされていたなら、それらの各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ麻痺カウンター１個を置く。（麻痺カウンターが置かれているパーマネントがアンタップ状態になるなら、代わりにそれの上から麻痺カウンター１個を取り除く。）\\nあなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4dd7981-a121-44c3-9afc-b9d42e13eeec\', \'multiverseId\': 575819}, \'multiverseid\': 575819}, {\'name\': \'Ganhar Tempo\', \'text\': \'Reforçar {1}{U} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {1}{U} ao conjurar esta mágica.)\\nVire até duas criaturas alvo. Se esta mágica foi reforçada, coloque um marcador de atordoamento em cada uma daquelas criaturas. (Se uma permanente com um marcador de atordoamento se tornaria desvirada, em vez disso, remova um marcador de atordoamento dela.)\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'863fa2fa-57d2-4dd9-9f8d-566c43054970\', \'multiverseId\': 576341}, \'multiverseid\': 576341}, {\'name\': \'时间拖延\', \'text\': \'增幅{1}{U}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{1}{U}。）\\n横置至多两个目标生物。如果此咒语已增幅，则在这些生物上各放置一个晕眩指示物。（如果某个其上有晕眩指示物的永久物将成为未横置，则改为从其上移去一个晕眩指示物。）\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'254c8704-e61a-4988-aa8b-cff1d5d52f2e\', \'multiverseId\': 576863}, \'multiverseid\': 576863}]', "[{'name': 'Zeitloser Lotus', 'text': 'Der Zeitlose Lotus kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}.', 'type': 'Legendäres Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Urza beutete die Natur aus, um seine Kriegsmaschinen anzutreiben. Mit der Zeit beutete die Natur seine Kriegsmaschinen aus, um sich zu erneuern.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574980&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a35668e-f619-4dd9-a926-ac684d050a99', 'multiverseId': 574980}, 'multiverseid': 574980}, {'name': 'Loto imperecedero', 'text': 'El Loto imperecedero entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}.', 'type': 'Artefacto legendario', 'flavor': 'Urza utilizaba la naturaleza para alimentar sus máquinas de guerra. Con el tiempo, la naturaleza utilizó sus máquinas de guerra para renovarse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575241&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcea75c0-b331-4503-afb1-c46f91b3435f', 'multiverseId': 575241}, 'multiverseid': 575241}, {'name': 'Lotus intemporel', 'text': 'Le Lotus intemporel arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}.', 'type': 'Artefact légendaire', 'flavor': 'Urza exploitait la nature pour alimenter ses machines de guerre. Avec le temps, la nature finit par exploiter ses machines de guerre pour se régénérer.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575502&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f239817-961e-4dde-a3e8-da6cdce9bd36', 'multiverseId': 575502}, 'multiverseid': 575502}, {'name': 'Loto Senza Tempo', 'text': 'Il Loto Senza Tempo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}.', 'type': 'Artefatto Leggendario', 'flavor': 'Urza sfruttò la natura per alimentare le sue macchine da guerra; col tempo, la natura sfruttò le sue macchine da guerra per rinnovarsi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575763&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a16daa4-d643-4ab4-861f-e3a6ecc46744', 'multiverseId': 575763}, 'multiverseid': 575763}, {'name': '永久の水蓮', 'text': '永久の水蓮はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': '伝説のアーティファクト', 'flavor': 'ウルザは戦争の機械の燃料として自然を乱用した。時は経ち、今度は自然が自己再生のために彼の戦争の機械を乱用した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576024&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a6c5dfb-9787-4020-95ec-eacf4d3d738c', 'multiverseId': 576024}, 'multiverseid': 576024}, {'name': 'Lótus Atemporal', 'text': 'Lótus Atemporal entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}.', 'type': 'Artefato Lendário', 'flavor': 'Urza explorou a natureza para alimentar suas máquinas de guerra; com o tempo, a natureza explorou as máquinas de guerra de Urza para se renovar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576546&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40a9ecc5-4ec7-4d1c-825d-b9a5f9ae196b', 'multiverseId': 576546}, 'multiverseid': 576546}, {'name': '永生莲花', 'text': '永生莲花须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}。', 'type': '传奇神器', 'flavor': '克撒曾滥用自然资源来为其战争机械助力；到头来，自然也滥用其战争机械来重生资源。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577068&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b84ce222-ce1c-4674-bfd4-8334752f69b4', 'multiverseId': 577068}, 'multiverseid': 577068}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zerlumpte Erscheinung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{1}{B}: Die Zerlumpte Erscheinung erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schatten\', \'flavor\': \'„Ah, ja, an den erinnere ich mich. Ich habe vor ein paar Jahrhunderten sein Innerstes nach außen gekehrt und seine Seele in einen endlosen Albtraum geschleudert."\\n—Braids\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574852&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5002c33-69aa-492f-b166-51aa65d54be2\', \'multiverseId\': 574852}, \'multiverseid\': 574852}, {\'name\': \'Fantasma andrajoso\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{1}{B}: El Fantasma andrajoso obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sombra\', \'flavor\': \'"Pues claro que lo recuerdo. Invertí su cuerpo y arrojé su alma a una pesadilla interminable hace unos cuantos siglos".\\n—Trenzas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfb28b6e-16a2-47ac-80e2-5586ee7ac1a0\', \'multiverseId\': 575113}, \'multiverseid\': 575113}, {\'name\': \'Apparition en lambeaux\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{1}{B} : L\'Apparition en lambeaux gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : ombre\', \'flavor\': "« Ah oui, je me souviens de lui. Je l\'ai retourné comme un gant et j\'ai lancé son âme dans un cauchemar sans fin il y a quelques siècles. »\\n—Nattes", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575374&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99839553-4893-4609-865d-3bfad5c88357\', \'multiverseId\': 575374}, \'multiverseid\': 575374}, {\'name\': \'Apparizione Lacera\', \'text\': "Volare\\n{1}{B}: L\'Apparizione Lacera prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ombra\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah sì, me lo ricordo. L\\\'ho rivoltato da dentro a fuori e ho condannato la sua anima a un incubo senza fine alcuni secoli fa."\\n—Braids\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c7604a7-4524-47d2-9ce6-c8dc049793c4\', \'multiverseId\': 575635}, \'multiverseid\': 575635}, {\'name\': \'ぼろぼろの亡霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{1}{B}：ターン終了時まで、ぼろぼろの亡霊は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — シェイド\', \'flavor\': \'「そうね、これは覚えているわ。たしか数世紀前、肉体を裏返しにして魂を永遠の悪夢に放り込んだのよ。」\\n――ブレイズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d8a1c84-1065-46c9-bf84-90b68af21abd\', \'multiverseId\': 575896}, \'multiverseid\': 575896}, {\'name\': \'Aparição Esfarrapada\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{1}{B}: Aparição Esfarrapada recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sombra\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah, sim, eu lembro desse aí. Eu virei ele do avesso e joguei a alma dele num pesadelo infinito uns séculos atrás."\\n— Braids\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'235905b4-cd32-4a95-907c-9fc9da4c704f\', \'multiverseId\': 576418}, \'multiverseid\': 576418}, {\'name\': \'褴褛亡灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{1}{B}：褴褛亡灵得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～阴魂\', \'flavor\': \'「啊，没错，我记得那家伙。几百年前我就把他里外翻了个面，把他的灵魂扔进了无尽的梦魇。」\\n～布蕾德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34033fff-ad9f-49d9-9e2c-3ed02f3d8a1b\', \'multiverseId\': 576940}, \'multiverseid\': 576940}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerschellender Goblin\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Zerschellende Goblin stirbt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'„Für einige ist Perfektion nur ein einziger Augenblick, in dem Form und Zweck konvergieren."\\n—Rona\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574850&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'630e4992-1761-4405-ba52-0c0309630ae5\', \'multiverseId\': 574850}, \'multiverseid\': 574850}, {\'name\': \'Trasgo salpicador\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Trasgo salpicador muera, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Para algunos, la perfección reside en el instante en el que convergen la forma y el propósito".\\n—Rona\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'755ede00-0184-4d3d-b48a-8a21a9c15c86\', \'multiverseId\': 575111}, \'multiverseid\': 575111}, {\'name\': \'Gobelin éclabousseur\', \'text\': "Quand le Gobelin éclabousseur meurt, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et gobelin\', \'flavor\': "« Pour certains, la perfection ne dure qu\'un instant, quand la forme et le dessein convergent. »\\n—Rona", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575372&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f8c63d1-a0aa-4e3d-8550-fd4548ecac8d\', \'multiverseId\': 575372}, \'multiverseid\': 575372}, {\'name\': \'Goblin da Sfracello\', \'text\': \'Quando il Goblin da Sfracello muore, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Per alcuni, la perfezione non è che un singolo momento in cui forma e funzione convergono."\\n—Rona\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a882696-95ae-4a99-bb1c-db51251a90d5\', \'multiverseId\': 575633}, \'multiverseid\': 575633}, {\'name\': \'跳ね散らすゴブリン\', \'text\': \'跳ね散らすゴブリンが死亡したとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'「一部の者にとっては、形状と目的が一点で交わる瞬間ほど完璧なものはないわ。」\\n――ローナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e8e163-9950-4972-8d73-8dc4f2859dea\', \'multiverseId\': 575894}, \'multiverseid\': 575894}, {\'name\': \'Goblin de Espatifamento\', \'text\': \'Quando Goblin de Espatifamento morre, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Phyrexiano Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Para alguns, a perfeição é aquele momento único quando a forma e o propósito se encontram."\\n— Rona\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'782090ca-b987-4649-a216-c3201635f84e\', \'multiverseId\': 576416}, \'multiverseid\': 576416}, {\'name\': \'空坠鬼怪\', \'text\': \'当空坠鬼怪死去时，目标由对手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／鬼怪\', \'flavor\': \'「对某些东西而言，完美不过是形意合一的那一瞬间。」\\n～罗娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48c1dde6-3617-4835-ac00-516c2aabaa6b\', \'multiverseId\': 576938}, \'multiverseid\': 576938}]', "[{'name': 'Zhalfirs Instabilität', 'text': 'Überblättern (Wähle ein Kapitel und beginne mit so vielen Sagenmarken. Füge nach deinem Ziehsegment eine hinzu. Übersprungene Kapitel werden nicht ausgelöst. Opfern nach III.)\\nI, II — Eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, destabilisiert sich. Sie kann sich nicht stabilisieren, solange du Zhalfirs Instabilität kontrollierst.\\nIII — Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Für jede auf diese Weise zerstörte Kreatur erzeugt ihr Beherrscher einen 2/2 schwarzen Phyrexianer-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574800&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3b1bbbc-5c1b-4891-8bf6-fb51087005a5', 'multiverseId': 574800}, 'multiverseid': 574800}, {'name': 'El cambio de fase de Zhalfir', 'text': 'Adelanto. (Elige un capítulo y empieza con esa misma cantidad de contadores de sabiduría. Añade uno después de tu paso de robar. Los capítulos omitidos no se disparan. Sacrifica esta Saga después de III.)\\nI, II — Otro permanente objetivo que no sea tierra sale de fase. No puede entrar en fase mientras controles El cambio de fase de Zhalfir.\\nIII — Destruye todas las criaturas. Por cada criatura destruida de esta manera, su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Pirexiano negra 2/2.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575061&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '996e7dad-79dd-44b8-b023-e16832bc25f1', 'multiverseId': 575061}, 'multiverseid': 575061}, {'name': 'Le déphasage de Zhalfir', 'text': 'Lecture rapide (Choisissez un chapitre et commencez avec autant de marqueurs « sapience ». Ajoutez-en un après votre étape de pioche. Les chapitres passés ne se déclenchent pas. Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI, II — Un autre permanent non-terrain ciblé passe hors phase. Il ne peut pas passer en phase tant que vous contrôlez Le déphasage de Zhalfir.\\nIII — Détruisez toutes les créatures. Pour chaque créature détruite de cette manière, son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Phyrexian.', 'type': 'Enchantement : saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575322&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11aeae51-02b7-4b23-8497-29cfab63248b', 'multiverseId': 575322}, 'multiverseid': 575322}, {'name': 'La Scomparsa di Zhalfir', 'text': 'Saltare pagina (Scegli un capitolo e inizia con quel numero di segnalini sapere. Aggiungine uno dopo la tua acquisizione. I capitoli saltati non si innescano. Sacrifica dopo III.)\\nI, II — Un altro permanente non terra bersaglio scompare. Non può apparire fintanto che controlli La Scomparsa di Zhalfir.\\nIII — Distruggi tutte le creature. Per ogni creatura distrutta in questo modo, il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Phyrexiano 2/2 nera.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575583&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43b54584-1cec-47f8-a43e-b73c4443235d', 'multiverseId': 575583}, 'multiverseid': 575583}, {'name': 'ザルファーのフェイジング', 'text': '先読（章を選び、それに等しい数の伝承カウンターで始める。あなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を追加する。飛ばされた章は誘発しない。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II — 土地でもこれでもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それはフェイズ・アウトする。あなたがザルファーのフェイジングをコントロールし続けているかぎり、それはフェイズ・インできない。\\nIII — すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。これにより破壊された各クリーチャーにつきそれぞれ、それのコントローラーは黒の２/２のファイレクシアン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575844&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b160f81-4eaa-4f8b-bf3d-428d33199e44', 'multiverseId': 575844}, 'multiverseid': 575844}, {'name': 'A Desmaterialização de Zhalfir', 'text': 'Adiantar leitura (Escolha um capítulo e comece com aquela quantidade de marcadores de conhecimento. Adicione um após sua etapa de compra. Os capítulos pulados não são desencadeados. Sacrifique-a após III.)\\nI, II — Outra permanente não de terreno alvo sai de fase. Ela não pode entrar em fase enquanto você controlar A Desmaterialização de Zhalfir.\\nIII — Destrua todas as criaturas. Para cada criatura destruída dessa forma, seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura Phyrexiano preta 2/2.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576366&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f235d716-8cc2-4ce3-aea3-3792ff9fc08a', 'multiverseId': 576366}, 'multiverseid': 576366}, {'name': '赛费尔跃离纪', 'text': '跳读（选择一个章节，此传纪一开始就有该数量的学问指示物。于你抓牌步骤后再加一个。跳过的章节不会触发。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI，II — 另一个目标非地永久物跃离。于你操控赛费尔跃离纪的时段内，它不能跃回。\\nIII — 消灭所有生物。对每个以此法消灭的生物而言，其操控者派出一个2/2黑色非瑞人衍生生物。', 'type': '结界 ～传纪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576888&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de8ef89e-63b1-45ba-af21-c3f9c93c5d57', 'multiverseId': 576888}, 'multiverseid': 576888}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zornfeuer-Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Zornfeuer-Höllendrache angreift, kannst du eine andere Kreatur opfern. Falls du dies tust, erhält der Zornfeuer-Höllendrache Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'„Nun, die gute Nachricht ist, dass das Geräusch kein Vulkanausbruch war …"\\n—George, Späher der Koalition\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577786&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2fc3e95-d5c2-4bbc-b7da-5c20765a06d9\', \'multiverseId\': 577786}, \'multiverseid\': 577786}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de furia ígnea\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Engendro de furia ígnea ataque, puedes sacrificar otra criatura. Si lo haces, el Engendro de furia ígnea gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo bueno es que ese ruido no era la erupción del volcán...".\\n—George, explorador de la Coalición\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2819e4b2-d531-465f-b357-a73e456e6536\', \'multiverseId\': 577791}, \'multiverseid\': 577791}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer ragefeu\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Escouflenfer ragefeu attaque, vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature. Si vous faites ainsi, l\'Escouflenfer ragefeu acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "« La bonne nouvelle, c\'est que ce bruit n\'était pas l\'éruption du volcan... »\\n—George, éclaireur de la coalition", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577796&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef1def7-6839-4ffc-abe5-ad171305e8ba\', \'multiverseId\': 577796}, \'multiverseid\': 577796}, {\'name\': "Nibbio Infernale dell\'Ira Ardente", \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Nibbio Infernale dell\'Ira Ardente attacca, puoi sacrificare un\'altra creatura. Se lo fai, il Nibbio Infernale dell\'Ira Ardente ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"Beh, la buona notizia è che quel suono non era il vulcano in eruzione..."\\n—George, esploratore della Coalizione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'795c7a06-b72e-4f60-88ea-b14a98f9dac7\', \'multiverseId\': 577801}, \'multiverseid\': 577801}, {\'name\': \'怒り火のヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n怒り火のヘルカイトが攻撃するたび、あなたはこれでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、怒り火のヘルカイトは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'「幸いなことに、火山の噴火の音ではなかったようだ……」\\n――連合の偵察兵、ジョージ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93ae7c8-6f56-40ee-8927-a4c2bbed025a\', \'multiverseId\': 577806}, \'multiverseid\': 577806}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Avérneo da Fúria Ígnea\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Dragão Avérneo da Fúria Ígnea ataca, você pode sacrificar outra criatura. Se fizer isso, Dragão Avérneo da Fúria Ígnea ganhará golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'"Bem, a boa notícia é que aquele barulho não era o vulcão entrando em erupção..."\\n— George, batedor da Coalizão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c933b575-6d3d-4363-b19f-dcc74bb370f2\', \'multiverseId\': 577816}, \'multiverseid\': 577816}, {\'name\': \'怒焰残虐者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当怒焰残虐者攻击时，你可以牺牲另一个生物。若你如此作，则怒焰残虐者获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'「好消息是，那声音不是火山爆发…」\\n～联盟斥候乔治\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85631e90-6c95-4cc9-bb37-6a045a95d3a4\', \'multiverseId\': 577826}, \'multiverseid\': 577826}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zornfeuer-Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Zornfeuer-Höllendrache angreift, kannst du eine andere Kreatur opfern. Falls du dies tust, erhält der Zornfeuer-Höllendrache Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577706&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e214bf6-79be-44dc-b147-e71ebbde2b37\', \'multiverseId\': 577706}, \'multiverseid\': 577706}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer ragefeu\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Escouflenfer ragefeu attaque, vous pouvez sacrifier une autre créature. Si vous faites ainsi, l\'Escouflenfer ragefeu acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577711&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19a018ea-05aa-4d50-835a-30497a664206\', \'multiverseId\': 577711}, \'multiverseid\': 577711}, {\'name\': \'怒り火のヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n怒り火のヘルカイトが攻撃するたび、あなたはこれでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、怒り火のヘルカイトは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b049ecaa-a0bb-4229-879d-3c46aee5f49f\', \'multiverseId\': 577716}, \'multiverseid\': 577716}, {\'name\': \'怒焰残虐者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当怒焰残虐者攻击时，你可以牺牲另一个生物。若你如此作，则怒焰残虐者获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f20f3f0-641f-4a5b-bdd4-bc5eb02ac841\', \'multiverseId\': 577721}, \'multiverseid\': 577721}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zu Staub zerschmettern\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\n• Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Verteidiger.\\n• Zu Staub zerschmettern fügt jeder Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574885&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40855802-672b-4b19-bc25-7aa1f634cf83\', \'multiverseId\': 574885}, \'multiverseid\': 574885}, {\'name\': \'Hacer polvo\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de defensor.\\n• Hacer polvo hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura que controlan tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64e999d8-59fe-4749-9ddf-8e8b083f4ed1\', \'multiverseId\': 575146}, \'multiverseid\': 575146}, {\'name\': \'Piler\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.\\n• Détruisez une créature avec le défenseur ciblée.\\n• Piler inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature que vos adversaires contrôlent.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575407&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd2300e7-0dc9-4edc-a819-6b911e57dcdd\', \'multiverseId\': 575407}, \'multiverseid\': 575407}, {\'name\': \'Ridurre in Macerie\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con difensore.\\n• Ridurre in Macerie infligge 1 danno a ogni creatura controllata dai tuoi avversari.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31b79029-3e5e-466d-a60a-b9dc4de167f5\', \'multiverseId\': 575668}, \'multiverseid\': 575668}, {\'name\': \'塵と化す\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n・防衛を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n・塵と化すは対戦相手がコントロールしている各クリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7ac676a-6335-45eb-9b5e-cc0ea34a0b8a\', \'multiverseId\': 575929}, \'multiverseid\': 575929}, {\'name\': \'Reduzir a Pó\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\\n• Destrua a criatura alvo com defensor.\\n• Reduzir a Pó causa 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura que seus oponentes controlam.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f32e20-b360-4556-9066-af5a1fca4940\', \'multiverseId\': 576451}, \'multiverseid\': 576451}, {\'name\': \'砸为粉尘\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•消灭目标神器。\\n•消灭目标具守军异能的生物。\\n•砸为粉尘向每个由对手操控的生物各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6189eaf7-e7c7-430a-81bc-bf2325cfcccf\', \'multiverseId\': 576973}, \'multiverseid\': 576973}]', "[{'name': 'Zur, ewiger Ränkeschmied', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nVerzauberungskreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung und Fluchsicherheit.\\n{1}{W}: Eine Nicht-Aura-Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, wird zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen zu einer Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft gleich ihrem Manabetrag.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574969&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '982e94ca-9958-4734-8688-346487faebf1', 'multiverseId': 574969}, 'multiverseid': 574969}, {'name': 'Zur, maquinador eterno', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nLas criaturas encantamiento que controlas tienen las habilidades de toque mortal, vínculo vital y antimaleficio.\\n{1}{W}: El encantamiento objetivo que no sea Aura que controlas se convierte en una criatura además de sus otros tipos y tiene una fuerza base y una resistencia base iguales a su valor de maná.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575230&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7a6a98b-559a-475b-a7e3-6f6ef4eca884', 'multiverseId': 575230}, 'multiverseid': 575230}, {'name': 'Zur, intrigant éternel', 'text': 'Vol\\nLes créatures-enchantements que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel, le lien de vie et la défense talismanique.\\n{1}{W} : Un enchantement non-Aura ciblé que vous contrôlez devient une créature en plus de ses autres types et a une force et une endurance de base chacune égales à sa valeur de mana.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575491&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8dacc4d6-23ca-4abd-bf24-1f049aedb49b', 'multiverseId': 575491}, 'multiverseid': 575491}, {'name': 'Zur, Cospiratore Eterno', 'text': 'Volare\\nLe creature incantesimo che controlli hanno tocco letale, legame vitale e anti-malocchio.\\n{1}{W}: Un incantesimo non Aura bersaglio che controlli diventa una creatura in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e ha forza base e costituzione base pari al suo valore di mana.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575752&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '124907df-368f-4958-a8bc-9ef7e781ba3b', 'multiverseId': 575752}, 'multiverseid': 575752}, {'name': '永遠の策謀家、ズアー', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・エンチャントは接死と絆魂と呪禁を持つ。\\n{1}{W}：あなたがコントロールしていてオーラでないエンチャント１つを対象とする。それは他のタイプに加えてクリーチャーになり、それの基本のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれそれのマナ総量に等しい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576013&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a4d2071-661f-4019-a7b7-d97f262ead99', 'multiverseId': 576013}, 'multiverseid': 576013}, {'name': 'Zur, Conspirador Eterno', 'text': 'Voar\\nAs criaturas encantamento que você controla têm toque mortífero, vínculo com a vida e resistência a magia.\\n{1}{W}: O encantamento não Aura alvo que você controla se torna uma criatura além de seus outros tipos e tem poder e resistência básicos iguais ao próprio valor de mana.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576535&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7257b904-e5dc-471f-8188-258236f9c4a2', 'multiverseId': 576535}, 'multiverseid': 576535}, {'name': '永世阴谋家祖尔', 'text': '飞行\\n由你操控的结界生物具有死触、系命与辟邪异能。\\n{1}{W}：目标由你操控的非灵气结界成为基础力量与基础防御力各等同于其法术力值的生物，且仍具有原本类别。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577057&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5db2ac18-4fda-4402-93df-e7e7fd117837', 'multiverseId': 577057}, 'multiverseid': 577057}]", "[{'name': 'Zur, ewiger Ränkeschmied', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nVerzauberungskreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung und Fluchsicherheit.\\n{1}{W}: Eine Nicht-Aura-Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, wird zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen zu einer Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft gleich ihrem Manabetrag.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577914&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd07a6c1a-09dc-405f-a531-b13468ed58a2', 'multiverseId': 577914}, 'multiverseid': 577914}, {'name': 'Zur, intrigant éternel', 'text': 'Vol\\nLes créatures-enchantements que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel, le lien de vie et la défense talismanique.\\n{1}{W} : Un enchantement non-Aura ciblé que vous contrôlez devient une créature en plus de ses autres types et a une force et une endurance de base chacune égales à sa valeur de mana.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577955&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'def76d90-82a2-43e0-a443-05ba18e0847f', 'multiverseId': 577955}, 'multiverseid': 577955}, {'name': '永遠の策謀家、ズアー', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・エンチャントは接死と絆魂と呪禁を持つ。\\n{1}{W}：あなたがコントロールしていてオーラでないエンチャント１つを対象とする。それは他のタイプに加えてクリーチャーになり、それの基本のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれそれのマナ総量に等しい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577996&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eda74b5f-7da4-4c1a-8648-46390d8fa873', 'multiverseId': 577996}, 'multiverseid': 577996}, {'name': '永世阴谋家祖尔', 'text': '飞行\\n由你操控的结界生物具有死触、系命与辟邪异能。\\n{1}{W}：目标由你操控的非灵气结界成为基础力量与基础防御力各等同于其法术力值的生物，且仍具有原本类别。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578037&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97a2049e-6f39-4693-9fed-5a9acd0aa3dc', 'multiverseId': 578037}, 'multiverseid': 578037}]", "[{'name': 'Zur, ewiger Ränkeschmied', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nVerzauberungskreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung und Fluchsicherheit.\\n{1}{W}: Eine Nicht-Aura-Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, wird zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen zu einer Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft gleich ihrem Manabetrag.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578121&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd07700d-ec9a-4c3e-a5a3-96533ebc5d15', 'multiverseId': 578121}, 'multiverseid': 578121}, {'name': 'Zur, maquinador eterno', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nLas criaturas encantamiento que controlas tienen las habilidades de toque mortal, vínculo vital y antimaleficio.\\n{1}{W}: El encantamiento objetivo que no sea Aura que controlas se convierte en una criatura además de sus otros tipos y tiene una fuerza base y una resistencia base iguales a su valor de maná.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578162&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52aa9d3d-71da-4963-9ebe-b9b2c75191bb', 'multiverseId': 578162}, 'multiverseid': 578162}, {'name': 'Zur, intrigant éternel', 'text': 'Vol\\nLes créatures-enchantements que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel, le lien de vie et la défense talismanique.\\n{1}{W} : Un enchantement non-Aura ciblé que vous contrôlez devient une créature en plus de ses autres types et a une force et une endurance de base chacune égales à sa valeur de mana.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578203&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86537582-cecd-4fef-b6ea-ae004baf6957', 'multiverseId': 578203}, 'multiverseid': 578203}, {'name': 'Zur, Cospiratore Eterno', 'text': 'Volare\\nLe creature incantesimo che controlli hanno tocco letale, legame vitale e anti-malocchio.\\n{1}{W}: Un incantesimo non Aura bersaglio che controlli diventa una creatura in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e ha forza base e costituzione base pari al suo valore di mana.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578244&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '382725c4-a03f-4557-82e1-3d744ea853dc', 'multiverseId': 578244}, 'multiverseid': 578244}, {'name': '永遠の策謀家、ズアー', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャー・エンチャントは接死と絆魂と呪禁を持つ。\\n{1}{W}：あなたがコントロールしていてオーラでないエンチャント１つを対象とする。それは他のタイプに加えてクリーチャーになり、それの基本のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれそれのマナ総量に等しい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578285&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bb47e0e-dd6f-479c-8c12-fdcb361d1eda', 'multiverseId': 578285}, 'multiverseid': 578285}, {'name': 'Zur, Conspirador Eterno', 'text': 'Voar\\nAs criaturas encantamento que você controla têm toque mortífero, vínculo com a vida e resistência a magia.\\n{1}{W}: O encantamento não Aura alvo que você controla se torna uma criatura além de seus outros tipos e tem poder e resistência básicos iguais ao próprio valor de mana.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578367&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b665a693-42cd-4885-8e52-0d660c076488', 'multiverseId': 578367}, 'multiverseid': 578367}, {'name': '永世阴谋家祖尔', 'text': '飞行\\n由你操控的结界生物具有死触、系命与辟邪异能。\\n{1}{W}：目标由你操控的非灵气结界成为基础力量与基础防御力各等同于其法术力值的生物，且仍具有原本类别。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～人类／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578449&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b478efb-8f75-497d-bb7d-9749dd3afae8', 'multiverseId': 578449}, 'multiverseid': 578449}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zusammenbeißen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Yavimaya kann auf sich aufpassen, die Kavu sind der Beweis dafür. Was hat eure Koalition zu bieten, das der Wald nicht bieten kann?"\\n—Jenson Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574896&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e0878a1-97f1-452f-9bc0-7e2389afa8f5\', \'multiverseId\': 574896}, \'multiverseid\': 574896}, {\'name\': \'Dentellada\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los kavu son la prueba de que Yavimaya sabe cuidarse sola. ¿Qué puede ofrecer tu Coalición que el bosque no tenga ya?".\\n—Jenson Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a652367-e178-478a-a9ee-6408f9319163\', \'multiverseId\': 575157}, \'multiverseid\': 575157}, {\'name\': \'Scrotch !\', \'text\': \'Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, que vous ne contrôlez pas.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« La Yavimaya prend soin d\'elle, les kavrus en sont la preuve. Que peut donc offrir votre Coalition que la forêt ne peut pas fournir ? »\\n—Jenson Carthalion", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575418&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efbc2a45-19aa-471c-a115-16a405f68196\', \'multiverseId\': 575418}, \'multiverseid\': 575418}, {\'name\': \'Addentare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Yavimaya sa prendersi cura di se stessa e i kavu ne sono la prova. Cosa può offrire la tua Coalizione che la foresta non ci fornisca già?"\\n—Jenson Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89ac03a7-c90b-4c48-b6db-dc34a5ab1077\', \'multiverseId\': 575679}, \'multiverseid\': 575679}, {\'name\': \'噛み締め\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちあなたがコントロールしていない１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ヤヴィマヤの面倒はヤヴィマヤが見る。カヴーがその証だ。そちらの連合は、森にないどんなものを差し出すのか？」\\n――ジェンソン・カルサリオン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d71dfa51-c53d-4ffd-8af0-4d0f4c3299de\', \'multiverseId\': 575940}, \'multiverseid\': 575940}, {\'name\': \'Abocanhar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla causa dano igual ao seu poder à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Yavimaya cuida de si; os kavus são prova disso. O que a sua Coalizão oferece que a floresta não possa proporcionar?"\\n— Jenson Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce909530-4839-4f40-8a63-99c96ff0c643\', \'multiverseId\': 576462}, \'multiverseid\': 576462}, {\'name\': \'一口咬碎\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物对目标不由你操控的生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「亚维马雅自给自足；卡甫便是佐证。你的联盟能给出什么森林提供不了的东西？」\\n～延森卡萨隆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2099d55f-580c-41fb-886b-1b8ec89f0d61\', \'multiverseId\': 576984}, \'multiverseid\': 576984}]', "[{'name': '|DFaUnEED lugtkenvr.', 'text': '|pcEnusL.\\n+Ⅰ: |co,tuhtZFsDYt,DEEtAGvEnyg,hruPYk. |be,GFGvEng,ME%uDM,MewknmQYpmuntKF G&E&guc,lYvDYh,co,nUCYc. |bY,GFGvEng,ME%uDM,MewknmQYpmuntKF,lYvDYh,svu tuhtZFsYt,BuaycCEtLodrm.\\n-Ⅲ: |co,PuuDs,suFshorskr%EDF,JysYt. |co,%E¹\\\\¹wYYSW%,hYpcGFPuuDs,SVhulYh. |GFPuuDs,zvEpnrYhm,JhEGFronz,tepyC.\\n-Ⅵ: |co,Ahecehm,neBYm. |co,tepuC/~besYf,fuDs,MewknmQYpmuntKF,bYBYK co,FsnUCA,JysYt cosF,%Y,MEQuuVV,tepuC.', 'type': '|MewknmQYpmunt DFaUnEED.', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578039&type=card', 'language': 'Phyrexian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e2af6c1-fdf1-4d04-bd74-f07da939110a', 'multiverseId': 578039}, 'multiverseid': 578039}]", "[{'name': '|gOcdrd,nETemk.', 'text': '|zvEZYCsDFhg.\\n|besYf,GvEng,mpreLYv co,LFr2ahoDYS.\\n|besYf,FsnUCA,GvEng mpreLv co,Lur2QYCut.', 'type': '|MewkfuDs fyrs,psewtr.', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=578038&type=card', 'language': 'Phyrexian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95ebbb6d-04f8-42ec-a1b7-6ca67994b8d3', 'multiverseId': 578038}, 'multiverseid': 578038}]", '[{\'name\': \'Äther-Kanalisierer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Äther-Kanalisierer ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n• Bringe eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=574783&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a5fe4dc-796f-406e-b948-f1b18f1787df\', \'multiverseId\': 574783}, \'multiverseid\': 574783}, {\'name\': \'Canalizador de éter\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Canalizador de éter entre al campo de batalla, elige uno:\\n• Crea una ficha de criatura Ave blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n• Regresa otro permanente objetivo que no sea tierra a la mano de su propietario.\\n• Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f831d17-268d-4ed3-afed-c27a7c03a8c7\', \'multiverseId\': 575044}, \'multiverseid\': 575044}, {\'name\': "Canaliseur d\'Éther", \'text\': "Quand le Canaliseur d\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.\\n• Renvoyez un autre permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575305&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e516e06-b285-4ee1-9bfc-2f432dec181a\', \'multiverseId\': 575305}, \'multiverseid\': 575305}, {\'name\': "Incanalatore d\'Etere", \'text\': "Quando l\'Incanalatore d\'Etere entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno —\\n• Crea una pedina creatura Uccello 1/1 bianca con volare.\\n• Fai tornare un altro permanente non terra bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\\n• Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad6d6bcb-bce9-43a3-9dbb-8d6ec3231cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 575566}, \'multiverseid\': 575566}, {\'name\': \'霊気の媒介者\', \'text\': \'霊気の媒介者が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n・土地でもこれでもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=575827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5776450c-cfee-40d3-88a3-1f8b67fe3d03\', \'multiverseId\': 575827}, \'multiverseid\': 575827}, {\'name\': \'Canalizador de Éter\', \'text\': \'Quando Canalizador de Éter entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um —\\n• Crie uma ficha de criatura Ave branca 1/1 com voar.\\n• Devolva outra permanente alvo não de terreno para a mão de seu dono.\\n• Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fea07d30-b5f8-47aa-99ae-8accb018da01\', \'multiverseId\': 576349}, \'multiverseid\': 576349}, {\'name\': \'乙太通导师\', \'text\': \'当乙太通导师进战场时，选择一项～\\n•派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生生物。\\n•将另一个目标非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n•抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=576871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51bd005b-33a9-403a-9c69-8447c546b329\', \'multiverseId\': 576871}, \'multiverseid\': 576871}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äther-Kanalisierer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Äther-Kanalisierer ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n• Bringe eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\n• Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577547&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c8d969f-4e4a-4e04-b3de-b97e386436cd\', \'multiverseId\': 577547}, \'multiverseid\': 577547}, {\'name\': "Canaliseur d\'Éther", \'text\': "Quand le Canaliseur d\'Éther arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.\\n• Renvoyez un autre permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n• Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577587&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31a3d862-5d28-4016-a367-bc645e5dee5d\', \'multiverseId\': 577587}, \'multiverseid\': 577587}, {\'name\': \'霊気の媒介者\', \'text\': \'霊気の媒介者が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n・土地でもこれでもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n・カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87039c95-b75c-4296-bcc3-822b75cf3398\', \'multiverseId\': 577627}, \'multiverseid\': 577627}, {\'name\': \'乙太通导师\', \'text\': \'当乙太通导师进战场时，选择一项～\\n•派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生生物。\\n•将另一个目标非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n•抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=577667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f877dd1-8b25-4a65-abf7-493bd0ddb913\', \'multiverseId\': 577667}, \'multiverseid\': 577667}]']
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AER', 'AFR', 'AJMP', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ALA', 'ANA', 'ANB', 'APC', 'ARC', 'ARN', 'ATH', 'AVR', 'BBD', 'BFZ', 'BLB', 'BRB', 'BRC', 'BRO', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'C21', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CST', 'DD1', 'DD2', 'DDC', 'DDD', 'DDE', 'DDF', 'DDG', 'DDH', 'DDI', 'DDJ', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDR', 'DDS', 'DDT', 'DDU', 'DKM', 'DMC', 'DMR', 'DMU', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DRB', 'DTK', 'DVD', 'E01', 'ELD', 'EMA', 'EVG', 'F01', 'FBB', 'FRF', 'G17', 'GDY', 'GK1', 'GK2', 'GN2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GRN', 'GS1', 'GVL', 'H09', 'HBG', 'HOP', 'HOU', 'ICE', 'IKO', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ISD', 'ITP', 'J14', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JVC', 'KHM', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCI', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'LTR', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'MD1', 'ME1', 'ME3', 'MH2', 'MH3', 'MID', 'MIR', 'MKC', 'MKM', 'MM2', 'MM3', 'MMQ', 'MOC', 'MOM', 'MOR', 'MRD', 'MUL', 'NEO', 'NPH', 'ODY', 'OGW', 'OLEP', 'ONE', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'OTC', 'OTJ', 'OTP', 'P02', 'P09', 'P23', 'P30T', 'PAL00', 'PAL01', 'PAL02', 'PAL03', 'PAL04', 'PAL05', 'PAL06', 'PAL99', 'PALP', 'PANA', 'PARL', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PCBB', 'PD2', 'PD3', 'PDGM', 'PDMU', 'PELP', 'PF19', 'PF20', 'PGPX', 'PGRU', 'PHUK', 'PIP', 'PL24', 'PLS', 'PLST', 'PM20', 'PMEI', 'PMPS', 'PMPS06', 'PMPS07', 'PMPS08', 'PMPS09', 'PMPS10', 'PMPS11', 'POR', 'PPP1', 'PPRO', 'PRM', 'PRW2', 'PRWK', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PSS2', 'PSS3', 'PSS4', 'PTC', 'PTK', 'PUMA', 'PWCS', 'PZ2', 'RAV', 'REX', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RQS', 'RTR', 'S99', 'SCD', 'SCH', 'SHM', 'SIR', 'SLD', 'SNC', 'SOI', 'SOM', 'SS1', 'STA', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TPR', 'TSB', 'TSP', 'UGL', 'UMA', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'V13', 'VIS', 'VOW', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['({T}: Add {B} or {G}.)\\nHaunted Mire enters the battlefield tapped.', '({T}: Add {B} or {R}.)\\nGeothermal Bog enters the battlefield tapped.', '({T}: Add {G} or {U}.)\\nTangled Islet enters the battlefield tapped.', '({T}: Add {G} or {W}.)\\nRadiant Grove enters the battlefield tapped.', '({T}: Add {R} or {G}.)\\nWooded Ridgeline enters the battlefield tapped.', '({T}: Add {R} or {W}.)\\nSacred Peaks enters the battlefield tapped.', '({T}: Add {U} or {B}.)\\nContaminated Aquifer enters the battlefield tapped.', '({T}: Add {U} or {R}.)\\nMolten Tributary enters the battlefield tapped.', '({T}: Add {W} or {B}.)\\nSunlit Marsh enters the battlefield tapped.', '({T}: Add {W} or {U}.)\\nIdyllic Beachfront enters the battlefield tapped.', '+1: Create a 1/1 red Monk creature token with prowess.\\n−1: Exile the top two cards of your library. Choose one of them. You may play that card this turn.\\n−2: Choose target creature an opponent controls. Whenever you attack this turn, Jaya, Fiery Negotiator deals damage equal to the number of attacking creatures to that creature.\\n−8: You get an emblem with "Whenever you cast a red instant or sorcery spell, copy it twice. You may choose new targets for the copies."', '+1: Create a tapped Powerstone token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}: Add {C}. This mana can\'t be spent to cast a nonartifact spell.")\\n−1: Pay any amount of mana. Look at that many cards from the top of your library, then put one of those cards into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\n−7: You get an emblem with "Tap an untapped artifact you control: This emblem deals 1 damage to any target."', '+1: Each player discards a card.\\n−2: Target player sacrifices a creature.\\n−6: Separate all permanents target player controls into two piles. That player sacrifices all permanents in the pile of their choice.', "As Stenn, Paranoid Partisan enters the battlefield, choose a card type other than creature or land.\\nSpells you cast of the chosen type cost {1} less to cast.\\n{1}{W}{U}: Exile Stenn. Return it to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\\nDraw two cards.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nDestroy target creature.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, create a 2/1 red Elemental creature token with trample and haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.\\n{T}: Search your library for a card, put it into your hand, then shuffle. Activate only if five or more creatures died this turn.', 'At the beginning of each end step, if a player discarded a card this turn, create a 1/1 black Bird creature token with flying and "This creature can\'t block."\\n{3}{B}, {T}: Each opponent discards a card. Activate only as a sorcery.', "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player may draw an additional card. If they do, spells they cast this turn cost {2} more to cast.", "At the beginning of your end step, choose one that hasn't been chosen —\\n• Draw a card.\\n• Each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.\\n• Sol'kanar the Tainted deals 3 damage to up to one other target creature or planeswalker.\\n• Exile Sol'kanar, then return it to the battlefield under an opponent's control.", 'At the beginning of your end step, if you control a creature with power greater than its base power, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token.', "At the beginning of your end step, you may sacrifice an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker. If you do, each opponent may sacrifice a permanent that shares a card type with it. For each opponent who doesn't, that player loses 2 life and you draw a card.", 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Destroy target creature with defender.\\n• Smash to Dust deals 1 damage to each creature your opponents control.', 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy target creature with toughness 4 or greater.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.', 'Choose one —\\n• When you cast your next instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.\\n• Target creature you control gains double strike until end of turn.', "Choose target creature you control and target creature you don't control. If you cast this spell during your main phase, the creature you control gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Then those creatures fight each other. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", 'Compleated ({Phyrexian Mana} can be paid with {G}, {W}, or 2 life. If life was paid, this planeswalker enters with two fewer loyalty counters.)\\n+1: Reveal the top card of your library. If it\'s a creature or planeswalker card, put it into your hand. Otherwise, you may put it on the bottom of your library.\\n−3: Distribute three +1/+1 counters among up to three target creatures. They gain vigilance until end of turn.\\n−6: You get an emblem with "Whenever you cast a creature or planeswalker spell, target opponent gets two poison counters."', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target noncreature spell.', 'Create three 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.', 'Cult Conscript enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{1}{B}: Return Cult Conscript from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only if a non-Skeleton creature died under your control this turn.', 'Deathtouch\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.\\nWhenever another creature you control dies, each opponent loses 1 life.', 'Deathtouch\\nWhenever you draw a card, you gain 2 life.\\nWhenever an opponent draws a card, they lose 2 life.', 'Deathtouch\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Defender\\nWhen Floriferous Vinewall enters the battlefield, look at the top six cards of your library. You may reveal a land card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Defender\\nWhen Shield-Wall Sentinel enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a creature card with defender, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Defender\\nWhen Wingmantle Chaplain enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Bird creature token with flying for each creature with defender you control.\\nWhenever another creature with defender enters the battlefield under your control, create a 1/1 white Bird creature token with flying.', 'Defender\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card. This ability triggers only once each turn.', 'Defender\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Target player mills X cards, where X is the number of creatures you control with defender. (To mill a card, a player puts the top card of their library into their graveyard.)', "Defender\\n{2}: Until end of turn, target creature with defender gains haste, can attack as though it didn't have defender, and assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power. Activate only as a sorcery.", 'Defender\\n{2}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', 'Defender\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Each opponent loses X life, where X is the number of creatures with defender you control.', 'Defender\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or creature with flying.', 'Destroy target creature or planeswalker. If its mana value was 3 or less, you gain 3 life.', 'Destroy target creature with total power and toughness 5 or less.', 'Domain — Artillery Blast deals X damage to target tapped creature, where X is 1 plus the number of basic land types among lands you control.', 'Domain — Create a 3/3 green Beast creature token for each basic land type among lands you control.\\n{1}{G}, Discard Herd Migration: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle. You gain 3 life.', 'Domain — Each creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is 1 plus the number of basic land types among lands you control.', 'Domain — Look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control. Put up to two of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard. You lose 2 life.', 'Domain — Search your library for up to two land cards that each have a basic land type, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. Look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control. Put up to one of them on top of your library and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Domain — Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each basic land type among lands you control.', "Domain — Territorial Maro's power and toughness are each equal to twice the number of basic land types among lands you control.", 'Domain — This spell costs {1} less to cast for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Domain — When Bortuk Bonerattle enters the battlefield, if you cast it, choose target creature card in your graveyard. Return that card to the battlefield if its mana value is less than or equal to the number of basic land types among lands you control. Otherwise, put it into your hand.', 'Domain — When Voda Sea Scavenger enters the battlefield, look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control. You may put one of those cards on top of your library. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Domain — Whenever Radha, Coalition Warlord becomes tapped, another target creature you control gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control.', 'Domain — Whenever Zar Ojanen, Scion of Efrava becomes tapped, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control with toughness less than the number of basic land types among lands you control.', 'Domain — {3}{G}: Until end of turn, Sunbathing Rootwalla gets +1/+1 for each basic land type among lands you control. Activate only once each turn.', 'Domain — {5}, {T}: Draw a card. This ability costs {1} less to activate for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Draw cards equal to the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, draw a card."\\nAs long as enchanted creature is legendary, it gets +1/+1 and has ward {1}. (Whenever enchanted creature becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it unless that player pays {1}.)', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Hammerhand enters the battlefield, target creature can't block this turn.\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has haste.", "Enlist (As this creature attacks, you may tap a nonattacking creature you control without summoning sickness. When you do, add its power to this creature's until end of turn.)", "Enlist (As this creature attacks, you may tap a nonattacking creature you control without summoning sickness. When you do, add its power to this creature's until end of turn.)\\nLinebreaker Baloth can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.", "Enlist (As this creature attacks, you may tap a nonattacking creature you control without summoning sickness. When you do, add its power to this creature's until end of turn.)\\nTrample", "Enlist (As this creature attacks, you may tap a nonattacking creature you control without summoning sickness. When you do, add its power to this creature's until end of turn.)\\nWhen Argivian Cavalier enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token.", "Enlist (As this creature attacks, you may tap a nonattacking creature you control without summoning sickness. When you do, add its power to this creature's until end of turn.)\\nWhen Balduvian Berserker dies, it deals damage equal to its power to any target.", "Enlist (As this creature attacks, you may tap a nonattacking creature you control without summoning sickness. When you do, add its power to this creature's until end of turn.)\\nWhenever Guardian of New Benalia enlists a creature, scry 2.\\nDiscard a card: Guardian of New Benalia gains indestructible until end of turn. Tap it.", "Enlist (As this creature attacks, you may tap a nonattacking creature you control without summoning sickness. When you do, add its power to this creature's until end of turn.)\\n{1}, Sacrifice Yavimaya Steelcrusher: Destroy target artifact.", 'Enlist\\nWhenever Guardian of New Benalia enlists a creature, scry 2.\\nDiscard a card: Guardian of New Benalia gains indestructible until end of turn. Tap it.', "Enlist\\nWhenever Keldon Flamesage attacks, look at the top X cards of your library, where X is Keldon Flamesage's power. You may exile an instant or sorcery card with mana value X or less from among them. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. You may cast the exiled card without paying its mana cost.", 'Equipped creature gets +2/+0.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Equipped creature gets +2/+1.\\nAs long as equipped creature is legendary, it has trample and haste.\\nEquip {2}', 'Exile up to one target artifact, up to one target creature, up to one target enchantment, up to one target planeswalker, and/or up to one target land. For each permanent exiled this way, its controller reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a card that shares a card type with it, puts that card onto the battlefield, then shuffles.', "First strike, vigilance, lifelink\\nWhen Danitha, Benalia's Hope enters the battlefield, you may put an Aura or Equipment card from your hand or graveyard onto the battlefield attached to Danitha.", 'First strike\\nAs an additional cost to cast red permanent spells, you may pay 2 life. Those spells cost {R} less to cast if you paid life this way. This effect reduces only the amount of red mana you pay.\\nWhenever you cast a red permanent spell, Defiler of Instinct deals 1 damage to any target.', "First strike\\nIf you would gain life, you gain that much life plus 1 instead.\\n{1}{W}: Knight of Dawn's Light gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", 'Flash\\nDomain — This spell costs {1} less to cast for each basic land type among lands you control.\\nWhen Leyline Binding enters the battlefield, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls until Leyline Binding leaves the battlefield.', 'Flash\\nKicker {2}{R} (You may pay an additional {2}{R} as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Cleaving Skyrider enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, it deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of attacking creatures.', 'Flash\\nOther Merfolk you control get +1/+1.\\nSacrifice a Merfolk: Counter target noncreature spell unless its controller pays {1}.', 'Flash\\nWhen Ertai Resurrected enters the battlefield, choose up to one —\\n• Counter target spell, activated ability, or triggered ability. Its controller draws a card.\\n• Destroy another target creature or planeswalker. Its controller draws a card.', 'Flash\\nWhen Prayer of Binding enters the battlefield, exile up to one target nonland permanent an opponent controls until Prayer of Binding leaves the battlefield. You gain 2 life.', 'Flash\\nWhen Resolute Reinforcements enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token.', 'Flying', "Flying, haste\\nPhoenix Chick can't block.\\nWhenever you attack with three or more creatures, you may pay {R}{R}. If you do, return Phoenix Chick from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped and attacking with a +1/+1 counter on it.", 'Flying, haste\\nShivan Devastator enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.', 'Flying, trample\\nAs Tyrannical Pitlord enters the battlefield, choose another creature you control.\\nThe chosen creature gets +3/+3 and has flying.\\nWhen Tyrannical Pitlord leaves the battlefield, sacrifice the chosen creature.', 'Flying, ward {2}\\nDomain — Whenever Sphinx of Clear Skies deals combat damage to a player, reveal the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Flying, ward {2}\\nDomain — Whenever Sphinx of Clear Skies deals combat damage to a player, reveal the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard. (Piles can be empty.)', 'Flying, ward {2}\\nOther Dragons you control have ward {2}.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if a creature or planeswalker an opponent controlled was dealt excess damage this turn, create a 4/4 red Dragon creature token with flying.', 'Flying\\nAs an additional cost to cast blue permanent spells, you may pay 2 life. Those spells cost {U} less to cast if you paid life this way. This effect reduces only the amount of blue mana you pay.\\nWhenever you cast a blue permanent spell, draw a card.', "Flying\\nAs long as Weatherlight Compleated has four or more phyresis counters on it, it's a Phyrexian creature in addition to its other types.\\nWhenever a creature you control dies, put a phyresis counter on Weatherlight Compleated. Then draw a card if it has seven or more phyresis counters on it. If it doesn't, scry 1.", 'Flying\\nDomain — Whenever Nael, Avizoa Aeronaut deals combat damage to a player, look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control. Put up to one of them on top of your library and the rest on the bottom in a random order. Then if there are five basic land types among lands you control, draw a card.', 'Flying\\nEnchantment creatures you control have deathtouch, lifelink, and hexproof.\\n{1}{W}: Target non-Aura enchantment you control becomes a creature in addition to its other types and has base power and base toughness each equal to its mana value.', "Flying\\nEnlist (As this creature attacks, you may tap a nonattacking creature you control without summoning sickness. When you do, add its power to this creature's until end of turn.)", "Flying\\nHaughty Djinn's power is equal to the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard.\\nInstant and sorcery spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.", 'Flying\\nOnce during each of your turns, you may play a land from your graveyard or cast a permanent spell with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard. If you do, it gains "When this permanent is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, exile it and you gain 2 life."', 'Flying\\nWhen Mesa Cavalier enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Talas Lookout dies, look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Ragefire Hellkite attacks, you may sacrifice another creature. If you do, Ragefire Hellkite gains double strike until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a player casts a spell that targets only a single creature other than Ivy, Gleeful Spellthief, you may copy that spell. The copy targets Ivy.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a player casts a spell that targets only a single creature other than Ivy, Gleeful Spellthief, you may copy that spell. The copy targets Ivy. (A copy of an Aura spell becomes a token.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, Griffin Protector gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever another creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, put two +1/+1 counters on that creature.', 'Flying\\nWhenever one or more other creatures die, put a +1/+1 counter on Sengir Connoisseur. This ability triggers only once each turn.', "Flying\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, choose one —\\n• Djinn of the Fountain gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n• Exile Djinn of the Fountain. Return it to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.\\n• Scry 1.", 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{1}{B}: Tattered Apparition gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{B}: Battlefly Swarm gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Dragon Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn. If this ability has been activated four or more times this turn, sacrifice Dragon Whelp at the beginning of the next end step.', "Haste\\nWhenever Squee, Dubious Monarch attacks, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token that's tapped and attacking.\\nYou may cast Squee, Dubious Monarch from your graveyard by paying {3}{R} and exiling four other cards from your graveyard rather than paying its mana cost.", "Jaya's Firenado deals 5 damage to target creature or planeswalker. Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)", "Karn's Sylex enters the battlefield tapped.\\nPlayers can't pay life to cast spells or to activate abilities that aren't mana abilities.\\n{X}, {T}, Exile Karn's Sylex: Destroy each nonland permanent with mana value X or less. Activate only as a sorcery.", 'Kicker {1}{B} (You may pay an additional {1}{B} as you cast this spell.)\\nDraw two cards. If this spell was kicked, each opponent discards a card.', 'Kicker {1}{B} (You may pay an additional {1}{B} as you cast this spell.)\\nExile target artifact or enchantment. If this spell was kicked, exile target nonland permanent instead.', 'Kicker {1}{B} (You may pay an additional {1}{B} as you cast this spell.)\\nLifelink\\nWhen Phyrexian Missionary enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Kicker {1}{G} (You may pay an additional {1}{G} as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying\\nIf Shalai's Acolyte was kicked, it enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.", 'Kicker {1}{G} (You may pay an additional {1}{G} as you cast this spell.)\\nReturn target creature card from your graveyard to your hand. You gain 2 life. If this spell was kicked, return another target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Kicker {1}{R} (You may pay an additional {1}{R} as you cast this spell.)\\nCreatures you control get +2/+1 until end of turn. If this spell was kicked, those creatures also gain trample until end of turn.', 'Kicker {1}{R} (You may pay an additional {1}{R} as you cast this spell.)\\nTarget creature gets -1/-0 until end of turn. If this spell was kicked, that creature blocks this turn if able.\\nDraw a card.', "Kicker {1}{R} and/or {1}{G}\\nVodalian Mindsinger enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it for each time it was kicked.\\nWhen Vodalian Mindsinger enters the battlefield, gain control of target creature with power less than Vodalian Mindsinger's power for as long as you control Vodalian Mindsinger.", 'Kicker {1}{U} (You may pay an additional {1}{U} as you cast this spell.)\\nTap up to two target creatures. If this spell was kicked, put a stun counter on each of those creatures. (If a permanent with a stun counter would become untapped, remove one from it instead.)\\nDraw a card.', 'Kicker {1}{U} (You may pay an additional {1}{U} as you cast this spell.)\\nTarget creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn. If this spell was kicked, that creature gets an additional -1/-1 until end of turn for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.', 'Kicker {1}{U} (You may pay an additional {1}{U} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Vineshaper Prodigy enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Kicker {1}{W} (You may pay an additional {1}{W} as you cast this spell.)\\nSearch your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. If this spell was kicked, create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.', 'Kicker {1}{W} (You may pay an additional {1}{W} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Keldon Strike Team enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens.\\nAs long as Keldon Strike Team entered the battlefield this turn, creatures you control have haste.', 'Kicker {1}{W} and/or {1}{U} (You may pay an additional {1}{W} and/or {1}{U} as you cast this spell.)\\nChoose up to X creatures and/or planeswalkers you control, where X is the number of times this spell was kicked. Those permanents phase out.\\nTemporal Firestorm deals 5 damage to each creature and each planeswalker.', 'Kicker {1}{W} and/or {1}{U}\\nChoose up to X creatures and/or planeswalkers you control, where X is the number of times this spell was kicked. Those permanents phase out.\\nTemporal Firestorm deals 5 damage to each creature and each planeswalker.', 'Kicker {2}{B} (You may pay an additional {2}{B} as you cast this spell.)\\nGain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. If this spell was kicked, sacrifice that creature at the beginning of the next end step.', "Kicker {2}{B} (You may pay an additional {2}{B} as you cast this spell.)\\nReturn target creature or planeswalker you don't control to its owner's hand. If this spell was kicked, put that permanent on the bottom of its owner's library instead.", 'Kicker {2}{G} (You may pay an additional {2}{G} as you cast this spell.)\\nHaste\\nIf Viashino Branchrider was kicked, it enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{2}{R}: Viashino Branchrider gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Kicker {2}{U} (You may pay an additional {2}{U} as you cast this spell.)\\nIf this spell was kicked, draw a card. Fires of Victory deals damage to target creature or planeswalker equal to the number of cards in your hand.', "Kicker {2}{U} (You may pay an additional {2}{U} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Ghitu Amplifier enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, return target creature an opponent controls to its owner's hand.\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Ghitu Amplifier gets +2/+0 until end of turn.", "Kicker {2}{W} (You may pay an additional {2}{W} as you cast this spell.)\\nReturn target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. If this spell was kicked, you gain life equal to that card's mana value. Otherwise, you lose that much life.\\nExile Sheoldred's Restoration.", 'Kicker {2}{W} (You may pay an additional {2}{W} as you cast this spell.)\\nTarget creature you control gets +2/+2 until end of turn. If this spell was kicked, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.', 'Kicker {3}{G} (You may pay an additional {3}{G} as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying\\nIf Pixie Illusionist was kicked, it enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{T}: Target land you control becomes the basic land type of your choice until end of turn.', "Kicker {3}{U} (You may pay an additional {3}{U} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Elvish Hydromancer enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, create a token that's a copy of target creature you control.", 'Kicker {B} (You may pay an additional {B} as you cast this spell.)\\nCreatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn. If this spell was kicked, whenever a creature you control dies this turn, draw a card.', 'Kicker {B} (You may pay an additional {B} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Benalish Sleeper enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, each player sacrifices a creature.', "Kicker {B} (You may pay an additional {B} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Bog Badger enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, creatures you control gain menace until end of turn. (A creature with menace can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Kicker {B} and/or {R} (You may pay an additional {B} and/or {R} as you cast this spell.)\\nFlying, lifelink\\nWhen Archangel of Wrath enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, it deals 2 damage to any target.\\nWhen Archangel of Wrath enters the battlefield, if it was kicked twice, it deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Kicker {B} and/or {R}\\nFlying, lifelink\\nWhen Archangel of Wrath enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, it deals 2 damage to any target.\\nWhen Archangel of Wrath enters the battlefield, if it was kicked twice, it deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Kicker {G} (You may pay an additional {G} as you cast this spell.)\\nIf this spell was kicked, put a +1/+1 counter on a creature you control.\\nAll creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Kicker {G} (You may pay an additional {G} as you cast this spell.)\\nScry 2, then draw a card. If this spell was kicked, you may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.', 'Kicker {G} (You may pay an additional {G} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Juniper Order Rootweaver enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.', 'Kicker {G} (You may pay an additional {G} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Sprouting Goblin enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, search your library for a land card with a basic land type, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\\n{R}, {T}, Sacrifice a land: Draw a card.', 'Kicker {G} and/or {W} (You may pay an additional {G} and/or {W} as you cast this spell.)\\nWhen Stronghold Arena enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life for each time it was kicked.\\nWhenever one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, you may reveal the top card of your library and put it into your hand. If you do, you lose life equal to its mana value.', 'Kicker {G} and/or {W}\\nWhen Stronghold Arena enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life for each time it was kicked.\\nWhenever one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to a player, you may reveal the top card of your library and put it into your hand. If you do, you lose life equal to its mana value.', 'Kicker {R} (You 